1
00:00:09,509 --> 00:00:12,721
(Butt Detective)
Hello. I'm Butt Detective.

2
00:00:13,221 --> 00:00:15,640
I'm sure you've heard
the talk of the town—

3
00:00:15,724 --> 00:00:18,601
the Phantom Thief Academy?

4
00:00:21,396 --> 00:00:23,231
Thieves who take their names—

5
00:00:23,314 --> 00:00:24,315
—from the alphabet.

6
00:00:24,399 --> 00:00:28,069
Villains who'll stoop to any
dirty trick to steal—

7
00:00:28,153 --> 00:00:30,864
an international
crime syndicate.

8
00:00:39,205 --> 00:00:42,876
{\an8}And his name...
is Phantom Thief U.

9
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:44,085
{\an8}Worldwide,

10
00:00:44,169 --> 00:00:46,296
{\an8}he sets his sights
on beautiful treasures—

11
00:00:46,379 --> 00:00:48,923
{\an8}a great thief whose true
identity is unknown.

12
00:00:49,007 --> 00:00:52,427
He, too, is a graduate
of the Phantom Thief Academy.

13
00:00:53,595 --> 00:00:57,724
And right now, that Academy's boss,
Phantom Thief G—

14
00:00:58,224 --> 00:01:00,310
is about to carry out
a terrifying scheme—

15
00:01:00,393 --> 00:01:02,520
known as the "Dark Age Plan."

16
00:01:03,021 --> 00:01:05,356
(Phantom Thief G)
To carry out this plan,

17
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:10,236
I need Butt Detective...
and the power of the Moonlight Stone.

18
00:01:11,362 --> 00:01:12,614
{\an8}(Butt Detective)
Just what is this plan—

19
00:01:12,697 --> 00:01:13,740
{\an8}—exactly?

20
00:01:15,325 --> 00:01:18,119
Will we be able to stop it?

21
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:20,789
And who will bear witness
to it all?

22
00:01:21,289 --> 00:01:23,041
{\an8}Why, none other than—

23
00:01:23,124 --> 00:01:24,667
{\an8}—all of you, watching this film.

24
00:01:34,135 --> 00:01:35,678
(Young Phantom Thief U) Come on over here.

25
00:01:37,013 --> 00:01:39,140
Whenever I hold the Moonlight Stone,

26
00:01:39,224 --> 00:01:42,227
I get this strange,
nostalgic feeling.

27
00:01:44,437 --> 00:01:48,775
And it fills me with this power—
like I could fly clear to the moon.

28
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,652
(Berry) Oh my, indeed!

29
00:01:50,735 --> 00:01:52,487
(Karasuda) Caw~ Got somethin'
in my eye.

30
00:01:53,738 --> 00:01:56,533
Someday, I'm going to the moon.

31
00:01:58,243 --> 00:01:59,828
Want to come with me?

32
00:02:09,963 --> 00:02:11,798
(Phantom Thief U)
Looking back, that moment—

33
00:02:11,881 --> 00:02:13,508
—may have been—

34
00:02:13,591 --> 00:02:16,803
the fork in the road
where our fates diverged.

35
00:02:17,679 --> 00:02:18,471
Hm?

36
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:32,986
(Phantom Thief B)
My, aren't we relaxed, Phantom Thief U.

37
00:02:33,069 --> 00:02:36,906
And here you don't even know
where the Moonlight Stone is.

38
00:02:36,990 --> 00:02:37,824
(Phantom Thief U) Berry.

39
00:02:37,907 --> 00:02:41,119
All we need to do is track
Phantom Thief G's movements.

40
00:02:41,619 --> 00:02:43,746
Send out this notice card,
would you?

41
00:02:44,247 --> 00:02:45,498
Mm—hup!

42
00:02:45,999 --> 00:02:48,251
Well, well. All together, I see.

43
00:02:48,751 --> 00:02:50,879
(Phantom Thief T)
I won't let you interfere
with the plan!

44
00:02:51,504 --> 00:02:53,590
If you're one of
Phantom Thief G's lackeys,

45
00:02:53,673 --> 00:02:55,466
then I suppose
that's only natural.

46
00:02:58,011 --> 00:03:00,138
(Phantom Thief B)
A word of advice, as a friend.

47
00:03:00,805 --> 00:03:01,723
Ah!

48
00:03:01,806 --> 00:03:04,601
(Phantom Thief B)
I'm afraid it's already decided.

49
00:03:04,684 --> 00:03:06,644
Your defeat, that is.

50
00:03:07,145 --> 00:03:10,315
Ah! Berry, what are you—

51
00:03:10,815 --> 00:03:12,025
Ngh... unh...

52
00:03:12,108 --> 00:03:15,028
"Very Bad Perfume:
Serenity."

53
00:03:15,528 --> 00:03:17,572
So relaxing it'll
knock you clean out—

54
00:03:17,655 --> 00:03:18,990
that's my
perfume.

55
00:03:21,242 --> 00:03:22,452
Satisfied now?

56
00:03:22,535 --> 00:03:25,413
(Phantom Thief Q)
So you DO listen, when it's
the Boss's orders.

57
00:03:25,496 --> 00:03:26,831
(Phantom Thief B)
Only so I don't get erased.

58
00:03:27,457 --> 00:03:29,042
(Phantom Thief H) Hnnngh!

59
00:03:29,125 --> 00:03:30,543
Ngaahh...

60
00:03:30,627 --> 00:03:32,295
(Phantom Thief Q) Pathetic.

61
00:03:32,378 --> 00:03:34,005
Let's just dump him
here already.

62
00:03:42,472 --> 00:03:44,724
(Phantom Thief H)
Trash goes in the trash can.

63
00:03:44,807 --> 00:03:46,267
Hup... whew...

64
00:03:46,351 --> 00:03:47,518
(Phantom Thief B) And out this goes too.

65
00:03:48,019 --> 00:03:48,561
(Phantom Thief Q) There we go.

66
00:03:53,775 --> 00:03:58,279
Just like before...
I fell.

67
00:04:07,372 --> 00:04:11,000
What lies ahead—
darkness? Or light?

68
00:04:11,668 --> 00:04:12,835
Or... something else?

69
00:04:20,551 --> 00:04:21,719
(Butt Detective)
Time to show—

70
00:04:21,803 --> 00:04:23,012
—the fruits of our practice.

71
00:04:23,096 --> 00:04:25,056
(Brown)
Let's give it all we've got!

72
00:04:25,139 --> 00:04:27,308
(Koala) Okay! Let's go!

73
00:04:27,392 --> 00:04:29,143
(All three) The Pretties!

74
00:04:30,061 --> 00:04:32,105
(Audience) Ohh~!

75
00:04:32,188 --> 00:04:33,523
So cute~!

76
00:04:33,606 --> 00:04:34,941
So cool!

77
00:04:35,024 --> 00:04:37,026
♪~

78
00:04:45,910 --> 00:04:48,955
(All three)
♪ 'Cause we're Dreaming, Dreaming

79
00:04:49,038 --> 00:04:51,958
{\an8}♪ The Pretties!

80
00:05:12,770 --> 00:05:14,105
(Master) Yikes!!

81
00:05:14,188 --> 00:05:15,815
(Suzu) Move it, old man!

82
00:05:15,898 --> 00:05:17,108
Take that!

83
00:05:17,191 --> 00:05:18,818
And that! And that!

84
00:05:18,901 --> 00:05:20,778
And thaaat!

85
00:05:20,862 --> 00:05:23,072
(Brown) Hm?
Reading it again?

86
00:05:23,156 --> 00:05:25,742
The letter from Phantom Thief U.

87
00:05:25,825 --> 00:05:26,576
Yes.

88
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,161
{\an8}(Phantom Thief U)
"In Phantom Thief G's hands—"

89
00:05:28,244 --> 00:05:29,912
{\an8}"the Moonlight Stone
has fallen."

90
00:05:30,413 --> 00:05:32,790
{\an8}"This is shaping up
to be an exciting game."

91
00:05:33,291 --> 00:05:35,001
{\an8}"The starting day
draws near."

92
00:05:35,501 --> 00:05:36,794
{\an8}"—Phantom Thief U"

93
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,714
(Butt Detective)
What does he mean by "game"...

94
00:05:40,214 --> 00:05:40,923
Hm...

95
00:05:42,258 --> 00:05:44,385
(Koala) Is Butt Detective here?

96
00:05:45,178 --> 00:05:47,930
(Brown) Hm?
Koala, what's wrong?

97
00:05:48,014 --> 00:05:49,932
I need you to find—

98
00:05:50,016 --> 00:05:51,517
—my cousin!

99
00:05:51,601 --> 00:05:54,979
Hm. Please, tell us more.

100
00:05:56,147 --> 00:05:59,192
(Koala) My cousin Cola's
been trying to become an idol,

101
00:05:59,275 --> 00:06:02,653
and not long ago, a contest
invitation came for her,

102
00:06:02,737 --> 00:06:05,656
but after she went to enter it,
she never came back.

103
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:06,866
Hm.

104
00:06:06,949 --> 00:06:09,452
When I asked one of
the contest staff,

105
00:06:09,535 --> 00:06:10,912
they said she lost

106
00:06:10,995 --> 00:06:14,207
and probably felt too ashamed
to face her family.

107
00:06:14,290 --> 00:06:16,584
But I don't buy that.

108
00:06:17,085 --> 00:06:19,587
Because before she left,
Cola was saying—

109
00:06:20,296 --> 00:06:22,632
(Cola) Even if this
doesn't work out,

110
00:06:22,715 --> 00:06:25,301
I will never give up
on my dream!

111
00:06:26,928 --> 00:06:28,012
(Brown) Hmm...

112
00:06:29,472 --> 00:06:30,264
(Brown) A dream?

113
00:06:31,933 --> 00:06:35,269
(Butt Detective) Hm.
I smell a case.

114
00:06:35,353 --> 00:06:36,354
(Koala) Maybe something happened,

115
00:06:36,437 --> 00:06:38,981
and she can't leave
Stardust Island.

116
00:06:39,065 --> 00:06:40,858
(Chief Maltese)
Stardust Island, you say?

117
00:06:40,942 --> 00:06:41,692
(All three) Hm?

118
00:06:41,776 --> 00:06:44,904
(Brown) Chief Maltese!
What are you doing here?

119
00:06:45,488 --> 00:06:46,989
(Chief Maltese) Off duty, lad.

120
00:06:47,573 --> 00:06:50,076
Between us, that island's
currently—

121
00:06:50,159 --> 00:06:52,453
under investigation by the
international police—

122
00:06:52,537 --> 00:06:53,579
Pawterpol.

123
00:06:53,663 --> 00:06:54,747
The reason being,

124
00:06:54,831 --> 00:06:56,833
the Phantom Thief Academy's
headquarters

125
00:06:56,916 --> 00:06:58,418
might just be hiding there!

126
00:06:58,501 --> 00:06:59,627
What?!

127
00:06:59,710 --> 00:07:01,754
(Suzu) The Phantom Thief Academy—

128
00:07:01,838 --> 00:07:05,842
isn't that the outfit that trains
thieves, the one Phantom Thief U was in?

129
00:07:06,425 --> 00:07:07,677
Wicked phantom thieves

130
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:11,264
stealing treasures from all
across the world, right?

131
00:07:11,347 --> 00:07:12,557
That's right.

132
00:07:13,558 --> 00:07:15,226
Their boss, Phantom Thief G,

133
00:07:15,309 --> 00:07:17,562
is trying to carry out a plan

134
00:07:17,645 --> 00:07:20,982
that would blanket the world in
darkness—the "Dark Age Plan."

135
00:07:21,065 --> 00:07:22,358
(Both) What?!

136
00:07:22,442 --> 00:07:24,902
(Chief Maltese)
Us Pupper Police,

137
00:07:24,986 --> 00:07:27,447
we've been asked to provide backup,

138
00:07:27,530 --> 00:07:30,825
but the island's big shot,
Star Mabushi,

139
00:07:30,908 --> 00:07:33,077
won't give us the time of day.

140
00:07:33,161 --> 00:07:37,206
Star Mabushi—now there's a name.
A huge star, back in the day.

141
00:07:37,707 --> 00:07:39,542
I was quite a fan myself.

142
00:07:41,878 --> 00:07:43,045
(Butt Detective) This is him?

143
00:07:43,671 --> 00:07:45,006
(Master) That's Star Mabushi.

144
00:07:45,715 --> 00:07:47,341
By the way, this pose—

145
00:07:47,925 --> 00:07:50,970
means "becoming the first star
that lights the way for all."

146
00:07:51,053 --> 00:07:53,055
That's the meaning behind it.

147
00:07:53,139 --> 00:07:53,890
Oh!

148
00:07:53,973 --> 00:07:56,893
He's the head judge
of the contest!

149
00:07:56,976 --> 00:07:58,019
(Master) Mabushi—

150
00:07:58,102 --> 00:08:00,146
turned Stardust Island
into a tourist spot—

151
00:08:00,229 --> 00:08:01,647
a truly admirable man.

152
00:08:01,731 --> 00:08:02,773
(Kashimasse) That's right!

153
00:08:02,857 --> 00:08:03,816
(Master) Huh?

154
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:06,110
(Kashimasse) And the star
attraction of it all—

155
00:08:06,194 --> 00:08:08,738
is the Stardust Contest,
you know!

156
00:08:08,821 --> 00:08:11,324
(Ooyachiaki) Countless stars
have made their debut there—

157
00:08:11,407 --> 00:08:12,366
(Mizube Miharu) Let's see...

158
00:08:12,450 --> 00:08:14,243
there's Buck-Tooth Beaver,

159
00:08:14,327 --> 00:08:16,329
and Sir Loses-a-Lot,

160
00:08:16,412 --> 00:08:18,748
(Dango Maruo)
If you win the contest,

161
00:08:18,831 --> 00:08:22,585
Mabushi gives you lessons
himself, one-on-one!

162
00:08:22,668 --> 00:08:23,502
Hnnf!

163
00:08:23,586 --> 00:08:25,171
(Butt Detective) I see.

164
00:08:25,254 --> 00:08:27,465
If we can get
an audience with Mabushi,

165
00:08:27,548 --> 00:08:29,967
we might just get a lead.

166
00:08:30,468 --> 00:08:31,802
Butt Detective, my boy!

167
00:08:31,886 --> 00:08:33,930
Enter the contest—

168
00:08:34,013 --> 00:08:35,014
—and win it!

169
00:08:35,097 --> 00:08:36,474
Hm.

170
00:08:37,141 --> 00:08:38,476
Consider it—

171
00:08:38,976 --> 00:08:40,978
—accepted.

172
00:08:41,062 --> 00:08:42,438
-(Chief Maltese) Ohh!
-(Koala) Yay!

173
00:08:42,522 --> 00:08:43,564
Thank you!

174
00:08:43,648 --> 00:08:45,191
The problem, though,

175
00:08:45,274 --> 00:08:48,236
is how in the world we're
going to win the contest.

176
00:08:48,319 --> 00:08:50,571
No matter how brilliant
a detective he is,

177
00:08:50,655 --> 00:08:52,740
when it comes to
singing and dancing...

178
00:08:52,823 --> 00:08:53,950
(Brown) Heh heh heh.

179
00:08:54,033 --> 00:08:54,825
(Chief Maltese & Koala) Hm?

180
00:08:54,909 --> 00:08:57,245
Well, if that's the problem...

181
00:08:57,328 --> 00:08:59,372
then there's no other way.

182
00:08:59,455 --> 00:09:00,539
We'll just have to—

183
00:09:00,623 --> 00:09:03,042
—form an idol group ourselves!

184
00:09:03,125 --> 00:09:04,543
-(Koala) Huh?!
-(Chief Maltese) Whaaat?

185
00:09:04,627 --> 00:09:05,753
What do you mean, "ourselves"?

186
00:09:05,836 --> 00:09:06,963
Me—

187
00:09:07,046 --> 00:09:09,298
—and Koala—

188
00:09:09,382 --> 00:09:11,467
—and Butt Detective, of course!

189
00:09:11,551 --> 00:09:13,594
Oh, right! For costumes,

190
00:09:13,678 --> 00:09:15,221
my mom used to—

191
00:09:15,304 --> 00:09:17,181
be in an idol group
called "the Pretties"—

192
00:09:17,265 --> 00:09:19,058
so I bet the old outfits
are still around!

193
00:09:19,141 --> 00:09:20,059
(Chief Maltese) Well, now.

194
00:09:20,142 --> 00:09:23,187
Fair warning—
my lessons are tough.

195
00:09:23,271 --> 00:09:25,314
You'd best be prepared.

196
00:09:25,398 --> 00:09:27,733
(Koala) One-two, one-two!

197
00:09:27,817 --> 00:09:29,277
(Brown) Wait, huh?

198
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:31,153
(Koala) Brown,
that's the wrong step!

199
00:09:31,237 --> 00:09:31,988
(Brown) Ah!

200
00:09:32,071 --> 00:09:32,822
(Koala) Hup!

201
00:09:32,905 --> 00:09:34,490
(Butt Detective) Hmmm.

202
00:09:36,617 --> 00:09:38,786
Let's call it a day, shall we?

203
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:40,496
(Chief Maltese) Oh, indeed!

204
00:09:40,580 --> 00:09:42,790
Now THAT'S a now,
young idol group!

205
00:09:42,873 --> 00:09:44,750
(All three) Right on!

206
00:09:44,834 --> 00:09:46,168
-(Butt Detective) Hm.
-(Koala & Brown) Yeah!

207
00:09:46,252 --> 00:09:47,503
Let's win this,

208
00:09:47,586 --> 00:09:50,965
and be sure to meet
Mabushi in person.

209
00:09:55,928 --> 00:09:57,930
"Idol 101," hm?

210
00:09:58,014 --> 00:10:01,142
You're certainly fired up,
Brown.

211
00:10:01,225 --> 00:10:02,143
As for me,

212
00:10:02,226 --> 00:10:04,812
please, call me "Pri-Brown."

213
00:10:04,895 --> 00:10:06,272
(Koala) Pri-Brown?

214
00:10:06,355 --> 00:10:08,232
You can be "Pri-Koala,"

215
00:10:08,316 --> 00:10:10,109
and Butt Detective—

216
00:10:10,192 --> 00:10:12,445
—is registered as "Pri-Butt."

217
00:10:12,528 --> 00:10:17,074
I mean, a stage name just makes
you seem more like a real star.

218
00:10:17,575 --> 00:10:18,409
Oop—

219
00:10:18,492 --> 00:10:21,412
silly Pri-Brown,
my hair's a mess.

220
00:10:21,495 --> 00:10:22,496
Huh?

221
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:23,623
(Chime)

222
00:10:24,123 --> 00:10:24,749
Hm.

223
00:10:25,458 --> 00:10:27,710
We'll be arriving shortly,

224
00:10:27,793 --> 00:10:29,920
at Stardust Island.

225
00:10:34,300 --> 00:10:35,843
Hmmm...

226
00:10:37,553 --> 00:10:39,889
(Brown) Whoa! For the contest,

227
00:10:39,972 --> 00:10:42,725
the place is packed
with tourists!

228
00:10:42,808 --> 00:10:47,647
(Lively chatter)

229
00:10:47,730 --> 00:10:50,608
(Brown) Oh, it's the famous
Star Juice!

230
00:10:50,691 --> 00:10:53,069
(Shopkeeper)
We've got Star Sweet Potatoes too!

231
00:10:53,152 --> 00:10:55,446
Only 150 today, so hurry!

232
00:10:55,529 --> 00:10:56,822
Wow!

233
00:10:56,906 --> 00:10:58,574
Three, please!

234
00:10:58,658 --> 00:10:59,825
(Koala) Brown,

235
00:10:59,909 --> 00:11:01,452
we're not sightseeing!

236
00:11:01,535 --> 00:11:02,912
-(Chief Maltese) Ohh!
-(All three) Hm?

237
00:11:02,995 --> 00:11:04,580
We've been expecting you.

238
00:11:04,663 --> 00:11:07,500
(Brown) The Pupper Police
detectives!

239
00:11:07,583 --> 00:11:09,043
(Thickneck) To help solve the case,

240
00:11:09,126 --> 00:11:11,504
we'll back you up with
everything we've got!

241
00:11:11,587 --> 00:11:13,798
(Perm) Star Juice—

242
00:11:13,881 --> 00:11:16,092
—schluuurp-tastic!

243
00:11:16,175 --> 00:11:18,386
(Bushy Brow)
Aren't we hitting the casino?

244
00:11:18,886 --> 00:11:19,970
(Sharp Ears)
Straight to the venue—

245
00:11:20,054 --> 00:11:20,930
—full speed ahead!

246
00:11:21,013 --> 00:11:22,223
Hm.

247
00:11:22,723 --> 00:11:24,475
Well then, we should—

248
00:11:24,558 --> 00:11:27,436
—head there too, right away.
Brown.

249
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:28,771
(Brown) Yes, sir!

250
00:11:28,854 --> 00:11:30,356
Whoa! Oh no...

251
00:11:31,816 --> 00:11:33,067
Aww...

252
00:11:33,651 --> 00:11:37,405
And I wanted Butt Detective
to try one...

253
00:11:37,488 --> 00:11:41,075
What a waste.
Sorry, little potato.

254
00:11:49,083 --> 00:11:50,209
Hm...

255
00:12:09,353 --> 00:12:12,106
(Star Mabushi) Everybody~!
Eyes on Mii!

256
00:12:12,690 --> 00:12:14,567
The world's biggest
star of all—

257
00:12:14,650 --> 00:12:17,027
it's Star Mabushi~!

258
00:12:17,111 --> 00:12:20,990
You all know about
the Stardust Contest, right?

259
00:12:21,073 --> 00:12:24,160
Where future stars clash
with song and dance—

260
00:12:24,243 --> 00:12:25,828
—in an all-out
survival battle!

261
00:12:26,495 --> 00:12:28,122
And of course, calling
the challenges—

262
00:12:28,205 --> 00:12:30,791
your host and head judge—

263
00:12:30,875 --> 00:12:33,127
(Audience) Star Mabushi~!

264
00:12:33,210 --> 00:12:34,879
Yes indeed!

265
00:12:34,962 --> 00:12:37,590
First, we'll pick—

266
00:12:37,673 --> 00:12:39,175
—the eight teams
for the tournament!

267
00:12:39,258 --> 00:12:41,218
First up—

268
00:12:41,302 --> 00:12:42,636
—the Pretties!

269
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:47,600
(Cheering)

270
00:12:47,683 --> 00:12:49,685
♪~

271
00:12:58,527 --> 00:13:01,572
(All three)
♪ 'Cause we're Dreaming, Dreaming

272
00:13:01,655 --> 00:13:03,032
♪ The Pretties!

273
00:13:03,115 --> 00:13:05,618
♪ Chasing down our biggest dreams

274
00:13:05,701 --> 00:13:08,370
♪ Let's make them bloom,
you and me

275
00:13:08,454 --> 00:13:10,998
♪ Dreaming, Dreaming

276
00:13:11,081 --> 00:13:12,500
♪ The Pretties!

277
00:13:12,583 --> 00:13:15,252
♪ Everyone's got their own—

278
00:13:15,336 --> 00:13:19,590
♪ —place to shine

279
00:13:19,673 --> 00:13:23,260
♪ Somewhere out there

280
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:28,140
♪ My baby, don't be shy now

281
00:13:28,224 --> 00:13:30,226
♪ Show a little more
of your heart

282
00:13:30,309 --> 00:13:32,436
♪ There's no such
thing as "can't"

283
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:33,771
♪ You're not alone

284
00:13:33,854 --> 00:13:37,525
♪ When all that fun,
all that joy

285
00:13:37,608 --> 00:13:39,610
♪ Starts dancing
right out of your heart

286
00:13:39,693 --> 00:13:44,073
♪ That's when it begins,
my friend

287
00:13:44,156 --> 00:13:46,408
♪ Follow that thrill—

288
00:13:46,492 --> 00:13:48,786
♪ —follow where it leads

289
00:13:48,869 --> 00:13:52,248
♪ And it all falls into place

290
00:13:52,331 --> 00:13:55,584
♪ 'Cause we're Dreaming, Dreaming

291
00:13:55,668 --> 00:13:57,127
♪ The Pretties!

292
00:13:57,211 --> 00:13:59,713
♪ Chasing down
our biggest dreams

293
00:13:59,797 --> 00:14:02,550
♪ Let's make them bloom,
you and me

294
00:14:02,633 --> 00:14:05,094
♪ Dreaming, Dreaming

295
00:14:05,177 --> 00:14:06,595
♪ The Pretties!

296
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:09,473
♪ Everyone's got their own—

297
00:14:09,557 --> 00:14:12,226
♪ —spotlight, on this stage

298
00:14:12,309 --> 00:14:14,144
♪ Yeah, even you

299
00:14:14,228 --> 00:14:18,440
♪ Have a place
that sparkles bright

300
00:14:18,524 --> 00:14:21,694
♪ Somewhere out there

301
00:14:23,863 --> 00:14:27,157
(Butt Detective) All of this, too,
is for the sake of solving the case.

302
00:14:27,241 --> 00:14:31,120
Still, I must admit—
being an idol isn't half bad.

303
00:14:32,997 --> 00:14:35,457
(Cheering)

304
00:14:35,541 --> 00:14:37,293
Nice, nice~

305
00:14:37,376 --> 00:14:39,420
By Mii's sole decision, you babies—

306
00:14:39,503 --> 00:14:41,338
—pass straight through the prelims!

307
00:14:41,422 --> 00:14:42,131
(Koala & Brown) Yes!!

308
00:14:42,756 --> 00:14:43,674
Hm...

309
00:14:43,757 --> 00:14:46,635
(Chief Maltese)
Victory's a sure thing now!

310
00:14:49,930 --> 00:14:51,765
(Phantom Thief K) ♪ Haaah~

311
00:14:51,849 --> 00:14:54,476
♪ Every day, every day~

312
00:14:55,060 --> 00:14:55,853
♪ Today too

313
00:14:56,437 --> 00:14:58,898
♪ Picking up trash,
hard at work

314
00:14:58,981 --> 00:14:59,815
...and there.

315
00:15:00,316 --> 00:15:02,651
Up we go... heh heh.

316
00:15:03,152 --> 00:15:03,944
Huh?

317
00:15:04,028 --> 00:15:07,281
Well, who left this
lyin' around?

318
00:15:07,364 --> 00:15:09,241
Why can't people clean
up after themselves?

319
00:15:10,743 --> 00:15:11,493
Whoa!

320
00:15:12,077 --> 00:15:16,081
What're you doin' here,
Phantom Thief U?

321
00:15:17,082 --> 00:15:20,085
(Phantom Thief U) Weren't you
erased by Phantom Thief G?

322
00:15:20,169 --> 00:15:22,796
Phantom Thief K, or should I say—
Karasuda.

323
00:15:23,297 --> 00:15:25,507
Ah, well, funny thing—

324
00:15:25,591 --> 00:15:28,052
next thing I knew,
I was down here.

325
00:15:28,135 --> 00:15:31,764
(Phantom Thief U) Not exactly
beautiful, is it.

326
00:15:32,431 --> 00:15:34,475
Feels like the inside
of a trash can.

327
00:15:34,558 --> 00:15:37,394
(Phantom Thief K) That's 'cause
it IS a trash town.

328
00:15:43,442 --> 00:15:44,360
Could it be—

329
00:15:44,443 --> 00:15:47,237
that the trash cans up on
the surface, and down here—

330
00:15:47,321 --> 00:15:48,989
—are connected?

331
00:15:49,615 --> 00:15:51,075
Yeah.

332
00:15:51,158 --> 00:15:53,535
But anything that
falls down here

333
00:15:53,619 --> 00:15:56,080
never makes it back
to the surface again.

334
00:15:56,163 --> 00:15:57,748
Ka-ha-ha-ha!

335
00:15:57,831 --> 00:16:00,125
You say that awfully cheerfully.

336
00:16:00,626 --> 00:16:03,253
(Phantom Thief K) 'Cause my chance
to escape just showed up.

337
00:16:03,337 --> 00:16:06,131
With the great phantom thief
Phantom Thief U here,

338
00:16:06,215 --> 00:16:07,800
we'll figure something out.

339
00:16:08,342 --> 00:16:10,636
Check this out.

340
00:16:10,719 --> 00:16:14,223
Swiped it right before
Phantom Thief G erased me.

341
00:16:14,848 --> 00:16:16,892
Any idea what it's about?

342
00:16:16,976 --> 00:16:17,935
(Phantom Thief U) Hmm...

343
00:16:18,018 --> 00:16:21,021
This is that building, isn't it.

344
00:16:21,605 --> 00:16:24,858
(Phantom Thief K) The Academy's been
building it round the clock.

345
00:16:24,942 --> 00:16:27,695
There's supposed to be
an elevator here.

346
00:16:28,278 --> 00:16:29,196
If we ride it up,

347
00:16:29,279 --> 00:16:31,407
I figure we could escape.

348
00:16:31,490 --> 00:16:34,118
But security's too tight,
can't get close.

349
00:16:34,743 --> 00:16:35,703
(Phantom Thief U) Oh?

350
00:16:36,286 --> 00:16:37,538
The Moonlight Stone.

351
00:16:38,038 --> 00:16:39,999
It's inside that building?

352
00:16:40,082 --> 00:16:43,210
Don't tell me...
Berry did this for—

353
00:16:44,962 --> 00:16:47,089
Hey, you listenin'?

354
00:16:47,172 --> 00:16:49,883
Heh. Nicely done, Karasuda.

355
00:16:49,967 --> 00:16:50,467
Huh?

356
00:16:50,551 --> 00:16:54,179
First, tell me everything
you know about this area.

357
00:16:54,263 --> 00:16:55,806
(warning sound)
(Phantom Thief U) Ah—

358
00:16:57,599 --> 00:17:00,227
(Catchbot)
SUSPICIOUS PERSON DETECTED.

359
00:17:00,310 --> 00:17:01,478
REGISTERING NOW.

360
00:17:01,562 --> 00:17:04,314
(Phantom Thief K)
Ugh, oh no—a Catchbot!

361
00:17:04,398 --> 00:17:04,940
(Phantom Thief U) A Catchbot?

362
00:17:05,023 --> 00:17:07,443
(Phantom Thief K)
A robot that patrols the town.

363
00:17:07,526 --> 00:17:10,028
Get caught, and it's forced
labor, no questions asked.

364
00:17:10,112 --> 00:17:11,989
(Phantom Thief U) I'd rather not,
thank you.

365
00:17:12,072 --> 00:17:14,283
I'll just borrow
what's on my back.

366
00:17:16,035 --> 00:17:18,037
(Catchbot) WHERE IS IT.
WHERE IS IT.

367
00:17:19,329 --> 00:17:20,581
(Phantom Thief U)
That worked out nicely.

368
00:17:20,664 --> 00:17:23,167
(Phantom Thief K)
Whew... that was close.

369
00:17:23,250 --> 00:17:25,961
Guess changin' how you look
does the trick.

370
00:17:28,422 --> 00:17:30,632
(Phantom Thief K)
Touch it, and you're toast.

371
00:17:30,716 --> 00:17:33,093
(Phantom Thief U)
A high-voltage fence, is it.

372
00:17:33,177 --> 00:17:35,220
Tighter security
than I expected.

373
00:17:35,304 --> 00:17:36,972
And on top of that,
that gate—

374
00:17:37,056 --> 00:17:38,432
—is guarded by a Catchbot.

375
00:17:38,515 --> 00:17:41,685
Only someone with a security
card can get through.

376
00:17:41,769 --> 00:17:45,439
(Phantom Thief U) To get inside,
we'll need more information.

377
00:17:45,522 --> 00:17:47,733
Ohh, I know just
the place for that.

378
00:17:49,067 --> 00:17:52,112
{\an8}Right here, this is it.

379
00:17:54,656 --> 00:17:56,075
(Owner) Welcome!

380
00:17:56,158 --> 00:17:58,202
(Phantom Thief K)
One Trash Burger, please.

381
00:17:58,285 --> 00:17:59,703
(Phantom Thief U) A drink for me.

382
00:17:59,787 --> 00:18:02,122
(Phantom Thief K) I'll pay with this.

383
00:18:02,206 --> 00:18:05,459
Ooh, now that's a fine
bit of garbage.

384
00:18:05,542 --> 00:18:06,627
Right?

385
00:18:06,710 --> 00:18:08,378
(Phantom Thief U) Barter, is it?

386
00:18:12,841 --> 00:18:15,177
(Phantom Thief K)
Where's my Trash Burger?

387
00:18:15,803 --> 00:18:16,678
Oh!

388
00:18:16,762 --> 00:18:19,348
I'll whip you up a fresh one.

389
00:18:22,476 --> 00:18:23,352
Here ya go.

390
00:18:23,435 --> 00:18:24,394
Ooh!

391
00:18:25,020 --> 00:18:26,438
(Phantom Thief U)
The things that fall from up top—

392
00:18:26,522 --> 00:18:27,648
—those are the menu?

393
00:18:27,731 --> 00:18:29,358
Huh? Yeah, that's right.

394
00:18:29,441 --> 00:18:32,528
Gotta feed the belly
before the back, y'know.

395
00:18:32,611 --> 00:18:35,781
You're not exactly beautiful,
but you sure are tough.

396
00:18:35,864 --> 00:18:38,242
Ka-ha-ha-ha!
Careful, you'll make me blush.

397
00:18:38,325 --> 00:18:39,868
-(Phantom Thief K) I'm blushin' already~
-(Phantom Thief U) Wait.

398
00:18:39,952 --> 00:18:40,994
Huh?

399
00:18:41,078 --> 00:18:43,831
I hear a conversation
that might give us a clue.

400
00:18:43,914 --> 00:18:44,790
Hm?

401
00:18:44,873 --> 00:18:48,502
(Chattering customers)

402
00:18:48,585 --> 00:18:50,838
(Owner)
Freshenin' it up, comin' right up.

403
00:18:50,921 --> 00:18:52,965
(Customer 1) You know the
"Catchbot Graveyard"?

404
00:18:53,048 --> 00:18:54,716
(Customer 2) Never heard of it.

405
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:57,970
(Customer 1) It's where all
the busted Catchbots get dumped.

406
00:18:58,470 --> 00:18:59,930
-(Phantom Thief U) Excuse me.
-(Customer 1) Hm?

407
00:19:00,013 --> 00:19:04,059
Would you mind telling us
where the Catchbot Graveyard is?

408
00:19:07,688 --> 00:19:08,939
(Phantom Thief K) Bold move.

409
00:19:09,022 --> 00:19:11,567
Using a busted
Catchbot like that.

410
00:19:11,650 --> 00:19:12,359
(Phantom Thief U) Shh.

411
00:19:12,442 --> 00:19:14,653
I'M BECOMING A ROBOT.

412
00:19:16,572 --> 00:19:19,241
(Phantom Thief K)
You do a mean robot voice.

413
00:19:23,579 --> 00:19:24,454
Ka-haa~

414
00:19:24,538 --> 00:19:27,124
Uh! Whoa!!

415
00:19:27,916 --> 00:19:28,959
(Catchbot 1) WHAT HAPPENED?

416
00:19:29,042 --> 00:19:30,085
(Catchbot 2) WHAT'S GOING ON?

417
00:19:33,672 --> 00:19:34,756
(Phantom Thief U) Reverse, reverse!

418
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:35,674
(Phantom Thief K) Huh?

419
00:19:36,967 --> 00:19:38,427
(Catchbot 1) NO ABNORMALITIES.

420
00:19:41,597 --> 00:19:44,099
(Staff)
Star Mabushi, coming through~!

421
00:19:47,269 --> 00:19:48,520
(Koala) Excuse me~

422
00:19:49,354 --> 00:19:51,940
Have you seen this
girl anywhere?

423
00:19:52,441 --> 00:19:54,109
A contest entrant?

424
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:56,528
Then she's an aspiring star.

425
00:19:57,029 --> 00:19:59,323
In that case,
she'd best win.

426
00:19:59,406 --> 00:20:01,575
Mii's the star
that shines in the sky,

427
00:20:01,658 --> 00:20:04,536
and babies are just eggs
still on the ground.

428
00:20:05,162 --> 00:20:08,040
Crack that shell and
come flying up here.

429
00:20:08,123 --> 00:20:08,999
-(Star Mabushi) Whoops.
-(Koala) Whoa!

430
00:20:09,082 --> 00:20:11,168
Careful, too close.

431
00:20:11,251 --> 00:20:14,630
Mii's radiance
might just blind you.

432
00:20:14,713 --> 00:20:15,213
Hmph.

433
00:20:19,593 --> 00:20:20,677
(Koala) There he goes.

434
00:20:20,761 --> 00:20:23,180
Something felt off about him.

435
00:20:23,263 --> 00:20:25,807
He just looks like he's
putting on airs.

436
00:20:25,891 --> 00:20:27,392
(whispering, hushed voice)
You two.

437
00:20:32,022 --> 00:20:32,814
Yes?

438
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:34,858
(Matchstick)
Someone with no respect—

439
00:20:34,942 --> 00:20:36,318
has no business
being a star—

440
00:20:36,818 --> 00:20:38,445
—not a chance, mattch!

441
00:20:38,528 --> 00:20:40,155
(Rabi and friends)
The winner of this contest

442
00:20:40,239 --> 00:20:42,699
is going to be us,
no question.

443
00:20:43,617 --> 00:20:45,452
(Kyupi)
I'm not losing either, kyupi.

444
00:20:45,535 --> 00:20:47,412
I worked two jobs at once

445
00:20:47,496 --> 00:20:49,456
just to make it here, kyupi.

446
00:20:49,539 --> 00:20:51,583
Even made my
costume myself, kyupi.

447
00:20:52,668 --> 00:20:55,837
(RYU) Do you two even
have the heart it takes—

448
00:20:55,921 --> 00:20:57,881
—to hold a real
passion for stardom?

449
00:20:58,382 --> 00:20:59,007
(Chick Squad 1) We're the ones—

450
00:20:59,091 --> 00:21:00,259
(Chick Squad 2)
—everyone said—

451
00:21:00,342 --> 00:21:02,177
(Chick Squad 3)
—could never make it, laughed at

452
00:21:02,260 --> 00:21:03,637
(Chick Squad 4) But for our
dream of stardom—

453
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:05,931
(All four) —we made it here!

454
00:21:07,933 --> 00:21:08,892
(Bamboo Shoot Shun 1)
We'll shed our skins

455
00:21:08,976 --> 00:21:10,519
and become stars,
no matter what—

456
00:21:10,602 --> 00:21:12,854
—because we've got
nowhere else to belong.

457
00:21:12,938 --> 00:21:15,232
What IS with these people?

458
00:21:15,315 --> 00:21:18,026
Our rivals—the other
idol hopefuls.

459
00:21:18,527 --> 00:21:20,821
Winning this
looks rough.

460
00:21:20,904 --> 00:21:23,073
(Butt Detective) Hm. Looks
like it's almost our turn.

461
00:21:23,156 --> 00:21:25,325
Let's just relax
and enjoy it.

462
00:21:25,826 --> 00:21:29,288
If we enjoy ourselves,
the audience should too.

463
00:21:29,371 --> 00:21:31,039
(Both) Ah... right!

464
00:21:31,540 --> 00:21:32,958
(Star Mabushi) Now then,
here they are—

465
00:21:33,041 --> 00:21:35,544
the eight groups who fought
through the preliminaries!

466
00:21:36,044 --> 00:21:37,296
Let's begin round one!

467
00:21:37,379 --> 00:21:39,006
Future stars,

468
00:21:39,089 --> 00:21:40,757
get out here already!

469
00:21:41,883 --> 00:21:43,969
{\an8}The Pretties VS RYU!

470
00:21:44,052 --> 00:21:46,805
(Chief Maltese) Let's go,
Butt Detective, my boy~!

471
00:21:46,888 --> 00:21:48,432
Your challenge is...

472
00:21:48,932 --> 00:21:50,267
Song!

473
00:21:50,892 --> 00:21:52,310
Mii's smash hit—

474
00:21:52,394 --> 00:21:54,479
the brand-new version
of "A Star, But What Kind?"

475
00:21:54,563 --> 00:21:57,941
Sing "A Star, But What Kind?
~Reborn~"—and get it right!

476
00:21:58,025 --> 00:22:00,402
Music, start!

477
00:22:00,485 --> 00:22:01,987
♪~

478
00:22:03,613 --> 00:22:06,783
♪ I shine, I'm a star

479
00:22:06,867 --> 00:22:09,536
♪ I'm always a star

480
00:22:09,619 --> 00:22:14,833
♪ The star that's rich
in calcium is...

481
00:22:15,625 --> 00:22:17,878
♪ ...a starfish!

482
00:22:19,171 --> 00:22:22,090
♪ Then, what star is sour?

483
00:22:22,674 --> 00:22:24,885
(Koala) Wait, I don't
know this song!

484
00:22:24,968 --> 00:22:25,594
Um...

485
00:22:25,677 --> 00:22:30,974
♪ Then, what star is sour

486
00:22:31,058 --> 00:22:33,185
♪ A lemon!

487
00:22:33,268 --> 00:22:36,146
♪ Hmm, that would
be a starfruit

488
00:22:36,229 --> 00:22:37,606
(Star Mabushi)
♪ That's right, starfruit!

489
00:22:37,689 --> 00:22:43,195
♪ But the only star
Mii needs is Mii

490
00:22:44,237 --> 00:22:46,656
And the winner is...
the Pretties~!

491
00:22:46,740 --> 00:22:47,574
{\an8}(Koala & Brown) Yes!!

492
00:22:47,657 --> 00:22:49,910
(Chief Maltese) A brand-new
song, no less!

493
00:22:49,993 --> 00:22:51,036
(Detectives) Amazing~!

494
00:22:54,331 --> 00:22:55,165
{\an8}(Star Mabushi) Now then—

495
00:22:55,248 --> 00:22:56,958
{\an8}the tournament final is—

496
00:22:57,709 --> 00:22:58,877
{\an8}the Pretties VS

497
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:00,670
{\an8}Bamboo Shoot Shun!

498
00:23:00,754 --> 00:23:03,006
(Chief Maltese) Win it allll~!

499
00:23:03,090 --> 00:23:05,050
Your challenge is...

500
00:23:05,550 --> 00:23:06,760
Action!

501
00:23:06,843 --> 00:23:08,011
Theme...

502
00:23:08,095 --> 00:23:09,346
Smiling!

503
00:23:09,429 --> 00:23:10,555
(Audience) Huh?

504
00:23:10,639 --> 00:23:12,307
A star's smile is everything.

505
00:23:12,974 --> 00:23:14,559
Mii will be your model.

506
00:23:14,643 --> 00:23:16,645
Who can come closest?

507
00:23:16,728 --> 00:23:18,230
Here we go~

508
00:23:18,313 --> 00:23:21,108
Shining over Stardust Island—

509
00:23:21,191 --> 00:23:21,983
—the first star of all!

510
00:23:22,067 --> 00:23:23,318
Hm.

511
00:23:23,402 --> 00:23:26,196
(Star Mabushi) Now,
action—no sound allowed!

512
00:23:28,949 --> 00:23:32,119
No winking, and
peace signs are a no.

513
00:23:34,246 --> 00:23:35,705
Way too stiff.

514
00:23:35,789 --> 00:23:38,041
Planning a trip to the
dentist with that grimace?

515
00:23:40,210 --> 00:23:41,878
Hmph! Cheeky.

516
00:23:43,547 --> 00:23:45,423
Stomachache, is it?

517
00:23:45,924 --> 00:23:47,134
(Bamboo Shoot Shun 2)
Here we go~!

518
00:23:47,217 --> 00:23:47,717
(Star Mabushi) Huh?

519
00:23:47,801 --> 00:23:48,969
(Bamboo Shoot Shun 3)
Bamboo Shoot—

520
00:23:49,594 --> 00:23:50,470
(Bamboo Shoot Shun 4)
—Shun!

521
00:23:50,554 --> 00:23:53,432
And there we go—those three
who made a sound, disqualified~!

522
00:23:54,558 --> 00:23:56,476
So then, the one who
came closest to Mii—

523
00:23:56,560 --> 00:23:58,186
—the one with
Pri-Butt on their team—

524
00:23:58,270 --> 00:24:00,147
—the Pretties win~!

525
00:24:00,230 --> 00:24:01,106
(Bamboo Shoot Shun) Shuuun...

526
00:24:01,189 --> 00:24:04,943
(Chief Maltese & co.)
L-O-V-E, the Pretties!

527
00:24:05,026 --> 00:24:07,154
(Star Mabushi)
At last, the final battle!

528
00:24:07,237 --> 00:24:09,281
Last month's champion, UnazyU—

529
00:24:09,364 --> 00:24:11,283
up against the
tournament's winners—

530
00:24:11,366 --> 00:24:13,326
—the Pretties!

531
00:24:14,327 --> 00:24:16,204
Uh-oh-oh-oh!

532
00:24:16,288 --> 00:24:16,830
Whoops...

533
00:24:16,913 --> 00:24:18,957
(UnazyU 1) Time to show you—

534
00:24:19,040 --> 00:24:20,041
—just how well we shimmy!

535
00:24:20,709 --> 00:24:22,127
(Star Mabushi)
Your challenge is...

536
00:24:22,627 --> 00:24:23,628
Rhythm!

537
00:24:23,712 --> 00:24:24,963
After all, a star who can't—

538
00:24:25,046 --> 00:24:27,257
—dance is no star at all.

539
00:24:27,340 --> 00:24:30,719
Whoever makes Mii shine
brightest gets the most points!

540
00:24:30,802 --> 00:24:32,012
-(Butt Detective) Hm.
-(Both) Hm?

541
00:24:32,095 --> 00:24:34,055
To make him shine...

542
00:24:34,139 --> 00:24:35,515
(Star Mabushi) And now—

543
00:24:35,599 --> 00:24:37,976
—let's start!

544
00:24:38,059 --> 00:24:40,061
♪~

545
00:24:44,691 --> 00:24:48,570
♪ Welcome to my star

546
00:24:48,653 --> 00:24:51,907
♪ Come on over to my star

547
00:24:51,990 --> 00:24:55,452
♪ Climb aboard
the moonlit ship

548
00:24:55,952 --> 00:24:58,663
♪ Climb aboard my ship

549
00:24:59,247 --> 00:25:02,334
♪ Look up at the galaxy

550
00:25:02,417 --> 00:25:05,670
♪ The first star is me

551
00:25:05,754 --> 00:25:09,299
♪ The second star is me too

552
00:25:09,382 --> 00:25:12,636
♪ Every single star is me

553
00:25:13,345 --> 00:25:16,264
♪ Shining bright

554
00:25:16,348 --> 00:25:19,684
♪ Shining a little too bright

555
00:25:19,768 --> 00:25:23,355
(Murmuring)

556
00:25:24,022 --> 00:25:25,023
Hm?

557
00:25:25,106 --> 00:25:26,316
Wh-what?

558
00:25:26,942 --> 00:25:29,819
(Star Mabushi) A star,
inside a star?!

559
00:25:29,903 --> 00:25:32,614
Just how brightly
is Mii shining?

560
00:25:32,697 --> 00:25:35,825
The word "dazzling" doesn't
even begin to cover it.

561
00:25:36,618 --> 00:25:38,453
(Star Mabushi)
Nice backup dancing!

562
00:25:39,120 --> 00:25:40,205
The winner is...

563
00:25:40,789 --> 00:25:42,040
—the Pretties!

564
00:25:42,123 --> 00:25:43,416
(Koala & Brown) Yes!!

565
00:25:44,125 --> 00:25:45,085
(Audience)
Way to go, Pretties!

566
00:25:45,168 --> 00:25:46,878
(Audience) So cool!

567
00:25:47,712 --> 00:25:50,006
(Chief Maltese)
Magnificent, Pretties!

568
00:25:51,007 --> 00:25:52,968
This is where
it really counts.

569
00:25:53,051 --> 00:25:55,845
It's up to you now,
Butt Detective, my boy.

570
00:25:56,471 --> 00:25:58,848
(Brown) That makes
us big stars now!

571
00:25:58,932 --> 00:26:00,558
(Koala) We finally
get to talk to Mabushi!

572
00:26:01,142 --> 00:26:03,853
(Butt Detective) The game
truly begins now.

573
00:26:03,937 --> 00:26:05,397
(UnazyU 1) Hey, you two.

574
00:26:05,480 --> 00:26:06,273
Hm?

575
00:26:06,356 --> 00:26:07,941
Cheers to you.

576
00:26:08,024 --> 00:26:10,568
Especially you, old man—
you're something else.

577
00:26:10,652 --> 00:26:12,988
Losing this round stings,

578
00:26:13,071 --> 00:26:14,781
but we'll keep trying,

579
00:26:14,864 --> 00:26:16,241
to grab hold of our dream!

580
00:26:16,324 --> 00:26:17,826
Thank you.

581
00:26:17,909 --> 00:26:18,952
We're rooting for you.

582
00:26:19,536 --> 00:26:21,204
(Brown) A dream, huh...

583
00:26:21,288 --> 00:26:22,414
Come to think,
that guy—

584
00:26:24,624 --> 00:26:27,502
I wonder if his dream
ever came true.

585
00:26:28,211 --> 00:26:30,046
(Phantom Thief K)
Where's that elevator?

586
00:26:30,130 --> 00:26:32,215
Hm? What's with those two?

587
00:26:32,299 --> 00:26:35,176
(Phantom Thief U) They look
possessed by something.

588
00:26:35,260 --> 00:26:37,887
(Phantom Thief K)
Elevator first, questions later.

589
00:26:38,805 --> 00:26:40,890
The Dark Age Plan, hm.

590
00:26:40,974 --> 00:26:42,767
-(Phantom Thief I) Well, well~
-(Phantom Thief K) Whoa!

591
00:26:42,851 --> 00:26:44,269
(Phantom Thief I) Hee-hee-hee-hee.

592
00:26:44,352 --> 00:26:46,938
I'd know that voice
anywhere, Phantom Thief K.

593
00:26:47,022 --> 00:26:48,273
So you're alive.

594
00:26:48,356 --> 00:26:49,983
(Phantom Thief K) Phantom Thief I.

595
00:26:50,066 --> 00:26:51,192
(Phantom Thief I)
And the other one is...

596
00:26:54,863 --> 00:26:57,032
A pleasure to meet you,
my lady.

597
00:26:57,115 --> 00:26:59,284
Who's this smooth-talker?

598
00:26:59,993 --> 00:27:01,411
(Phantom Thief K)
Don't recognize him?

599
00:27:03,622 --> 00:27:05,248
It's Phantom Thief U.

600
00:27:05,332 --> 00:27:07,792
Oh! I've been
dying to meet you.

601
00:27:07,876 --> 00:27:11,713
Without the Moonlight Stone, the
G-Shuttle would never be complete.

602
00:27:11,796 --> 00:27:15,091
So that spaceship is
called the G-Shuttle.

603
00:27:15,175 --> 00:27:17,385
Wait, THAT was a spaceship?

604
00:27:17,469 --> 00:27:20,221
Hold on, you can even
build spaceships?

605
00:27:20,805 --> 00:27:22,057
Because I'm a genius,
that's why.

606
00:27:22,140 --> 00:27:25,644
I have a mountain of questions
about the Moonlight Stone.

607
00:27:25,727 --> 00:27:28,396
Give it back, and I'll
tell you everything.

608
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:30,774
(Phantom Thief I)
Hmph! Out of the question.

609
00:27:30,857 --> 00:27:33,652
I want to see the G-Shuttle
fly with my own eyes.

610
00:27:33,735 --> 00:27:36,738
Do you understand what
it means, for that thing to fly?

611
00:27:37,447 --> 00:27:38,948
I don't want to understand.

612
00:27:39,032 --> 00:27:42,077
That's why I put on
this Go-To Helmet.

613
00:27:42,577 --> 00:27:44,663
No past, no future needed.

614
00:27:44,746 --> 00:27:47,207
I'm the one who invents
anything and everything—

615
00:27:47,290 --> 00:27:49,292
—that's who I became:
Phantom Thief I.

616
00:27:49,376 --> 00:27:50,085
Hee~

617
00:27:50,835 --> 00:27:52,087
Beautiful.

618
00:27:52,170 --> 00:27:53,171
You understand—

619
00:27:53,254 --> 00:27:55,632
—just how wonderful
my inventions are?

620
00:27:55,715 --> 00:27:56,299
Hee hee hee...

621
00:27:56,383 --> 00:28:00,387
Your heart—wishing to see
nothing at all. That's what's beautiful.

622
00:28:00,470 --> 00:28:01,471
Hee...

623
00:28:02,514 --> 00:28:03,598
(G-Squad) *skitter skitter*...

624
00:28:03,682 --> 00:28:04,682
*skitter skitter*...

625
00:28:04,766 --> 00:28:05,558
(Phantom Thief K) Hm?

626
00:28:05,642 --> 00:28:07,685
-(Phantom Thief K) Ka-ka-ka! Ka-ka-ka...
-(Phantom Thief U & Phantom Thief I) Hm?

627
00:28:07,769 --> 00:28:09,062
(Phantom Thief K) The G-Squad!

628
00:28:09,145 --> 00:28:10,397
(G-Squad 1) *Skitter-skiss~!*

629
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:12,357
So we were being watched.

630
00:28:12,857 --> 00:28:13,692
(Phantom Thief K) Hm?

631
00:28:13,775 --> 00:28:15,610
Huh? Wait?

632
00:28:16,194 --> 00:28:18,154
(Catchbot 1)
SUSPICIOUS PERSON DETECTED.

633
00:28:18,238 --> 00:28:20,323
(Catchbot 2)
SUSPICIOUS PERSON DETECTED.

634
00:28:20,990 --> 00:28:22,784
(Phantom Thief K)
Oh no! We're surrounded!

635
00:28:22,867 --> 00:28:25,787
Hey! I'm the one who
created you, you know!

636
00:28:25,870 --> 00:28:29,374
SUBJECT OBSERVED CONVERSING
FAMILIARLY WITH SUSPICIOUS PERSON.

637
00:28:29,457 --> 00:28:30,500
CLASSIFIED AS HOSTILE.

638
00:28:30,583 --> 00:28:31,543
What?!

639
00:28:31,626 --> 00:28:33,378
You could've made
them more flexible,

640
00:28:33,461 --> 00:28:34,629
you know!

641
00:28:34,712 --> 00:28:36,131
(Phantom Thief I)
Well, if that's how it is—

642
00:28:36,798 --> 00:28:37,549
(Phantom Thief K & Phantom Thief U) Huh?

643
00:28:37,632 --> 00:28:38,717
(Phantom Thief I) Run for it~!

644
00:28:38,800 --> 00:28:40,260
(Catchbot 1)
DO NOT LET THEM ESCAPE.

645
00:28:41,761 --> 00:28:42,804
Ka~!

646
00:28:42,887 --> 00:28:43,638
Hurry it up!

647
00:28:44,931 --> 00:28:46,558
Ka! Ka! Ka! Kaaa~!

648
00:28:50,812 --> 00:28:51,521
Ka-ha!

649
00:28:51,604 --> 00:28:52,355
(Phantom Thief I) A Catchbot

650
00:28:52,439 --> 00:28:54,065
can suck up any
trash lying around

651
00:28:54,149 --> 00:28:56,860
and keep firing an
endless stream of ammo.

652
00:28:56,943 --> 00:28:58,069
Impressive, right?

653
00:28:58,153 --> 00:28:59,988
(Phantom Thief K) This ain't
the time to brag, ka-aaah~!

654
00:29:01,322 --> 00:29:04,159
(Butt Detective) Where is
he now? What's he up to?

655
00:29:05,285 --> 00:29:07,412
(Staff) This way—this
is Mabushi's dressing room.

656
00:29:09,038 --> 00:29:10,582
I've brought them.

657
00:29:10,665 --> 00:29:11,875
(Star Mabushi) Okay.

658
00:29:13,001 --> 00:29:14,127
Go on in.

659
00:29:14,711 --> 00:29:16,337
Excuse us!

660
00:29:19,340 --> 00:29:20,049
(Butt Detective) Hm...

661
00:29:22,469 --> 00:29:22,969
(Staff) Hehe.

662
00:29:24,971 --> 00:29:26,556
(Star Mabushi)
The Pretties, was it?

663
00:29:27,265 --> 00:29:30,393
Let's get you babies a worldwide
debut, with you front and center.

664
00:29:30,477 --> 00:29:32,770
Oh, um, that's
awfully sudden—

665
00:29:32,854 --> 00:29:34,355
—we couldn't possibly~

666
00:29:34,439 --> 00:29:37,192
Let's just get the
lesson started already.

667
00:29:37,275 --> 00:29:40,361
Go on and sign that
contract right there.

668
00:29:40,862 --> 00:29:41,654
(Brown) Yes, sir!

669
00:29:42,155 --> 00:29:43,448
Mm~

670
00:29:43,531 --> 00:29:46,409
(Butt Detective) Before that,
there's something I'd like to confirm.

671
00:29:46,493 --> 00:29:48,369
Forgive me, but—

672
00:29:48,453 --> 00:29:49,621
—are you really,

673
00:29:49,704 --> 00:29:51,789
truly, Star Mabushi?

674
00:29:51,873 --> 00:29:52,373
(Koala & Brown) Huh?!

675
00:29:52,457 --> 00:29:53,625
(Star Mabushi) Pfft.

676
00:29:54,167 --> 00:29:55,835
What are you talking about?

677
00:29:55,919 --> 00:29:57,670
M-Mii is—

678
00:29:58,505 --> 00:30:01,591
shining over Stardust Island—

679
00:30:02,759 --> 00:30:04,135
—the first star of all—

680
00:30:04,219 --> 00:30:05,720
—Star Mabushi!

681
00:30:06,221 --> 00:30:09,307
Hmmm. That signature
pose of yours—

682
00:30:09,390 --> 00:30:11,893
—seems to be slightly
different from how it used to be?

683
00:30:11,976 --> 00:30:12,477
(Brown & Koala) Huh?

684
00:30:12,560 --> 00:30:14,062
Different how?

685
00:30:14,145 --> 00:30:16,231
The angle of your
right-hand fingers.

686
00:30:18,650 --> 00:30:22,028
Do this long enough,
even a pose is bound to change.

687
00:30:22,111 --> 00:30:24,489
But originally,

688
00:30:24,572 --> 00:30:28,409
"becoming the first star
that lights the way for all"—

689
00:30:28,493 --> 00:30:31,037
—that was supposed
to be its meaning.

690
00:30:31,538 --> 00:30:32,830
The way you strike
it looks like—

691
00:30:32,914 --> 00:30:36,084
—you just want the
attention on yourself.

692
00:30:36,167 --> 00:30:37,585
(Star Mabushi) Shaddaaap!

693
00:30:38,253 --> 00:30:41,506
Do you even want Mii's
gracious lessons or not?

694
00:30:41,589 --> 00:30:44,717
Hm. Let's try a different
question, then.

695
00:30:44,801 --> 00:30:46,052
Huh?

696
00:30:46,135 --> 00:30:47,262
In this room,

697
00:30:47,345 --> 00:30:50,223
there's something on the floor
that shouldn't be here.

698
00:30:50,306 --> 00:30:52,392
(Brown) Huh? Where?

699
00:30:52,934 --> 00:30:53,893
(Koala) Ah—

700
00:30:56,187 --> 00:30:56,729
Hm?

701
00:30:58,648 --> 00:31:00,692
It's Kyupi's stick.

702
00:31:00,775 --> 00:31:01,526
Yeah!

703
00:31:01,609 --> 00:31:03,236
Your lessons

704
00:31:03,319 --> 00:31:05,989
are only for the winners,
aren't they?

705
00:31:06,489 --> 00:31:09,742
So why is a loser's stick
lying on the floor?

706
00:31:09,826 --> 00:31:12,871
Huh? Maybe a staff
member dropped it?

707
00:31:12,954 --> 00:31:14,622
(Groaning) (Both) Hm?

708
00:31:17,500 --> 00:31:19,210
(Both) Whoa!!

709
00:31:19,919 --> 00:31:21,296
Ahh!

710
00:31:21,379 --> 00:31:23,715
Ohh~ that?

711
00:31:23,798 --> 00:31:26,134
Was just thinking
of tossing it out.

712
00:31:26,217 --> 00:31:28,595
Why would you do
something so awful...

713
00:31:28,678 --> 00:31:29,470
Pfft.

714
00:31:29,554 --> 00:31:31,055
-(Rabi 1) Pfft.
-(hushed voice) Haah...

715
00:31:31,681 --> 00:31:32,432
(Bamboo Shoot Shun 1) Haah...

716
00:31:33,725 --> 00:31:36,394
(Star Mabushi) Anyone who
couldn't shine as a star—

717
00:31:36,477 --> 00:31:38,479
—doesn't make any
money, does it?

718
00:31:38,980 --> 00:31:41,190
Merch doesn't sell either,

719
00:31:41,274 --> 00:31:42,650
so they just get tossed—

720
00:31:42,734 --> 00:31:43,234
Ah—

721
00:31:43,902 --> 00:31:45,820
I mean, you'd toss
it too, right?

722
00:31:45,904 --> 00:31:48,114
What is he even saying?

723
00:31:48,197 --> 00:31:49,782
Makes no sense at all.

724
00:31:50,450 --> 00:31:53,578
Guess you two will be working
underground too, then.

725
00:31:57,373 --> 00:31:58,833
(Knock)

726
00:31:58,916 --> 00:31:59,542
(Star Mabushi) Hm?

727
00:32:02,837 --> 00:32:04,380
(Phantom Thief G) No need to rush.

728
00:32:05,131 --> 00:32:07,592
He's an important guest.

729
00:32:11,512 --> 00:32:15,058
Good day to you,
Butt Detective, my boy.

730
00:32:15,767 --> 00:32:17,143
Phantom Thief G.

731
00:32:17,644 --> 00:32:19,771
This is the first time

732
00:32:19,854 --> 00:32:21,022
we've met in person,
isn't it?

733
00:32:21,105 --> 00:32:22,231
Heh...

734
00:32:24,567 --> 00:32:27,362
So this is the one, hm—

735
00:32:27,445 --> 00:32:29,197
the one who registered under—

736
00:32:29,280 --> 00:32:31,741
such a ridiculous
name, "Pri-Butt,"

737
00:32:31,824 --> 00:32:33,451
that I didn't even notice.

738
00:32:35,995 --> 00:32:39,749
Well, well, quite the popular
little group, the Pretties.

739
00:32:39,832 --> 00:32:43,336
Already putting you straight
to work making money for us.

740
00:32:43,419 --> 00:32:47,090
Whoa~ our own photo cards!

741
00:32:47,173 --> 00:32:47,924
Hm?

742
00:32:50,802 --> 00:32:53,971
My face is barely
even in it.

743
00:32:54,055 --> 00:32:57,934
The Dark Age Plan doesn't
come cheap, you know.

744
00:32:58,017 --> 00:33:00,728
Thanks to this island
buzzing with the contest,

745
00:33:00,812 --> 00:33:02,563
we've been getting by just fine.

746
00:33:02,647 --> 00:33:05,775
Just by swapping out
their leader, Star Mabushi,

747
00:33:05,858 --> 00:33:08,069
everything's fallen
right into place.

748
00:33:08,152 --> 00:33:09,404
Heheh.

749
00:33:09,487 --> 00:33:11,990
Mii's true identity
is Phantom Thief S.

750
00:33:12,073 --> 00:33:13,991
The Boss gave me this face,

751
00:33:14,075 --> 00:33:18,079
and every day, I get to steal
the eyes of every fan in the crowd.

752
00:33:18,162 --> 00:33:18,663
Heh.

753
00:33:18,746 --> 00:33:21,499
So you really were a fake.

754
00:33:21,582 --> 00:33:23,209
-(Catchbot 1) HALT.
-(Catchbot 2) STOP.

755
00:33:23,292 --> 00:33:24,919
(Phantom Thief K) Ka~!

756
00:33:30,425 --> 00:33:31,426
(Phantom Thief U) A dead end, hm.

757
00:33:31,509 --> 00:33:33,511
What do we do,
what do we do?!

758
00:33:33,594 --> 00:33:35,304
(Mysterious figure)
Hey. Over here.

759
00:33:39,017 --> 00:33:40,351
(Catchbot 1)
WHERE DID THEY GO.

760
00:33:40,435 --> 00:33:41,894
(Mysterious figure)
Slipping away from

761
00:33:41,978 --> 00:33:43,688
their attacks like that—

762
00:33:43,771 --> 00:33:44,939
you two aren't ordinary.

763
00:33:45,606 --> 00:33:46,399
And you are?

764
00:33:46,983 --> 00:33:48,192
(Star) Star Mabushi.

765
00:33:48,693 --> 00:33:50,528
Captured by the
Phantom Thief Academy,

766
00:33:50,611 --> 00:33:52,822
and forced to
work down here.

767
00:33:52,905 --> 00:33:53,865
Ha ha ha ha!

768
00:33:53,948 --> 00:33:56,200
This ain't a laughing matter.

769
00:33:56,284 --> 00:33:57,827
(Star) Follow me, if you would.

770
00:34:02,123 --> 00:34:03,166
(Cider) A star?

771
00:34:03,249 --> 00:34:04,000
But what kind.

772
00:34:06,377 --> 00:34:07,754
Welcome to our hideout.

773
00:34:08,379 --> 00:34:10,173
We're the Resistance—

774
00:34:10,256 --> 00:34:12,550
rebels against the
Phantom Thief Academy.

775
00:34:12,633 --> 00:34:15,595
(Cola) While we help out
the people struggling in town,

776
00:34:15,678 --> 00:34:18,347
we're also looking for a
chance to escape to the surface.

777
00:34:18,431 --> 00:34:20,558
(Cider) In between shifts
of forced labor, that is.

778
00:34:20,641 --> 00:34:22,351
You two are in the
same boat, aren't you?

779
00:34:22,435 --> 00:34:24,520
Yeah, that's about right,

780
00:34:24,604 --> 00:34:26,564
but then a Catchbot
spotted us...

781
00:34:27,398 --> 00:34:30,068
We really do need to do
something about those things.

782
00:34:30,693 --> 00:34:32,028
-(Resistance 1) Wait a second.
-(Star) Hm?

783
00:34:32,111 --> 00:34:35,198
(Resistance 1) Wasn't this girl
coming and going from the lab before?

784
00:34:35,281 --> 00:34:37,074
(Resistance 2)
She's one of the Academy's, isn't she?

785
00:34:37,158 --> 00:34:39,994
(Resistance 3)
Huh? Sounds fishy.

786
00:34:40,077 --> 00:34:41,329
That's true, but—

787
00:34:41,412 --> 00:34:43,915
she could be the
key to our escape.

788
00:34:43,998 --> 00:34:45,541
She's a genius.

789
00:34:45,625 --> 00:34:46,501
Ah...

790
00:34:47,376 --> 00:34:49,295
(Brown) Ivory... a genius...

791
00:34:49,378 --> 00:34:52,757
Ngh... my head...

792
00:34:53,424 --> 00:34:55,051
If she's hunted
by Catchbots too,

793
00:34:55,134 --> 00:34:57,011
then she's in the
same boat we are.

794
00:34:57,512 --> 00:35:00,223
There's no faking the
shine I sense in her.

795
00:35:00,306 --> 00:35:01,057
(Cola & Cider) Yeah.

796
00:35:01,140 --> 00:35:02,058
(Resistance members) Yeah.

797
00:35:02,141 --> 00:35:05,645
Phantom Thief I,
got any good ideas?

798
00:35:05,728 --> 00:35:06,771
Oh, honestly.

799
00:35:06,854 --> 00:35:08,815
It's risky, but
let's give it a shot.

800
00:35:10,608 --> 00:35:11,317
(Startup sound)

801
00:35:11,400 --> 00:35:13,361
(Keyboard clacking)

802
00:35:13,444 --> 00:35:16,114
(Phantom Thief I) If I can take
control of the Master Catchbot,

803
00:35:16,197 --> 00:35:18,825
all the other ones
will fall in line too.

804
00:35:18,908 --> 00:35:20,701
(Phantom Thief U) Excellent.

805
00:35:20,785 --> 00:35:22,578
(Phantom Thief I)
But there's a problem.

806
00:35:22,662 --> 00:35:23,830
Until my machine

807
00:35:23,913 --> 00:35:26,415
finishes linking up
with the Master Catchbot,

808
00:35:26,499 --> 00:35:29,669
we'll have to hold off attacks
from all the others.

809
00:35:29,752 --> 00:35:32,672
(Phantom Thief K) Those
things don't hold back.

810
00:35:32,755 --> 00:35:34,090
(Star) No problem!

811
00:35:34,173 --> 00:35:34,757
(Phantom Thief K and co.) Hm?

812
00:35:34,841 --> 00:35:38,302
We'll take on that job.

813
00:35:38,386 --> 00:35:40,346
Just gotta buy you
some time, right?

814
00:35:41,013 --> 00:35:43,808
Sounds like we've got
a plan, then.

815
00:35:45,226 --> 00:35:46,018
Now then.

816
00:35:46,102 --> 00:35:48,271
For you two—
the contest's losers—

817
00:35:48,354 --> 00:35:50,148
a workplace has
already been arranged.

818
00:35:54,944 --> 00:35:57,363
Take this elevator down,

819
00:35:57,446 --> 00:35:59,991
and start supporting
stars from behind the scenes.

820
00:36:00,074 --> 00:36:02,743
So there really is an
underground level.

821
00:36:02,827 --> 00:36:03,578
(Koala & Brown) Huh?

822
00:36:03,661 --> 00:36:05,788
When Brown threw
away that trash,

823
00:36:09,333 --> 00:36:11,544
something about
it felt off.

824
00:36:11,627 --> 00:36:14,046
Ah! Now that
you mention it,

825
00:36:14,130 --> 00:36:17,008
it didn't quite feel
like it landed there.

826
00:36:17,091 --> 00:36:19,218
What do you plan to
make us do down there?!

827
00:36:19,302 --> 00:36:22,555
(Phantom Thief G) You'll be building
what the Academy needs.

828
00:36:22,638 --> 00:36:25,850
(Phantom Thief S) With enough motivation,
you can work around the clock.

829
00:36:25,933 --> 00:36:27,310
What—

830
00:36:27,393 --> 00:36:30,771
Don't tell me Cola's been
forced to work down there too?

831
00:36:30,855 --> 00:36:32,023
(Phantom Thief G) Of course.

832
00:36:32,106 --> 00:36:34,984
She made for
excellent bait.

833
00:36:35,067 --> 00:36:37,361
So Cola's disappearance

834
00:36:37,445 --> 00:36:40,323
was all just a lure
to bring us to this island.

835
00:36:40,406 --> 00:36:43,159
(Phantom Thief G) Exactly right,
master detective.

836
00:36:43,784 --> 00:36:45,119
(Butt Detective) Hm...

837
00:36:47,914 --> 00:36:49,582
(Star) Operation, commence!

838
00:36:49,665 --> 00:36:52,126
Take control of
the Master Catchbot,

839
00:36:52,210 --> 00:36:54,170
and make our escape
by elevator~!

840
00:36:54,253 --> 00:36:55,796
(Everyone) Yeah~!

841
00:36:57,632 --> 00:36:59,383
Go! Go! Go!

842
00:36:59,467 --> 00:37:02,386
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

843
00:37:02,470 --> 00:37:03,429
(Phantom Thief K) Ka-ha!

844
00:37:04,430 --> 00:37:06,098
Time is short.

845
00:37:06,182 --> 00:37:07,934
Find the Master Catchbot.

846
00:37:08,017 --> 00:37:09,143
You got it!

847
00:37:10,937 --> 00:37:12,813
(Star) Follow Mii's lead~!

848
00:37:12,897 --> 00:37:16,150
Star Flying Drop!

849
00:37:16,233 --> 00:37:17,026
Ngh...

850
00:37:17,109 --> 00:37:18,694
(Phone ringing)
(Phantom Thief G) Hm?

851
00:37:21,197 --> 00:37:23,324
(G-Squad 2)
*skitter skitter, skitter-skiss~!*

852
00:37:23,407 --> 00:37:25,993
What did you say?
Let me check right now.

853
00:37:29,497 --> 00:37:31,290
Hm? This is...

854
00:37:31,374 --> 00:37:33,417
This is his doing.

855
00:37:33,501 --> 00:37:35,294
He's after the Moonlight Stone.

856
00:37:35,378 --> 00:37:37,838
(Butt Detective)
Him... the Moonlight Stone...

857
00:37:38,339 --> 00:37:40,174
Then that means he's—

858
00:37:41,801 --> 00:37:42,426
(Phantom Thief G) Hm?

859
00:37:43,302 --> 00:37:45,805
Why is Phantom Thief I
with them?

860
00:37:45,888 --> 00:37:46,847
Ah!

861
00:37:49,058 --> 00:37:52,395
Phantom Thief S, capture
Butt Detective!

862
00:37:52,478 --> 00:37:54,438
Drop the rest of
them down below!

863
00:37:54,522 --> 00:37:56,065
Yes, boss.

864
00:37:56,148 --> 00:37:57,692
(Butt Detective) I'm afraid
I can't allow that.

865
00:37:57,775 --> 00:37:59,318
(Koala) We'll fight too!

866
00:37:59,402 --> 00:38:01,529
(Bamboo Shoot Shun)
Nngh~ Hyah!

867
00:38:01,612 --> 00:38:04,240
(Rabi and friends) Nngh~ Hyah!

868
00:38:05,157 --> 00:38:07,868
Kyupi and friends
WILL become stars!

869
00:38:07,952 --> 00:38:11,038
Think you can handle
our passion?!

870
00:38:11,122 --> 00:38:14,000
(Phantom Thief S) You talentless
little star wannabes.

871
00:38:14,709 --> 00:38:15,710
Hm...

872
00:38:15,793 --> 00:38:17,837
Star Spin!

873
00:38:19,547 --> 00:38:21,340
(Brown) Whoaaa...

874
00:38:21,424 --> 00:38:22,800
(Phantom Thief S) Take tha—ah!

875
00:38:23,384 --> 00:38:24,302
Oof!

876
00:38:25,177 --> 00:38:25,886
(Phantom Thief N) Hup.

877
00:38:25,970 --> 00:38:27,680
(Phantom Thief Z) Since it's
off-limits

878
00:38:27,763 --> 00:38:30,099
to anyone not
directly involved,

879
00:38:30,182 --> 00:38:32,518
we figured we'd let
ourselves in from the top.

880
00:38:32,601 --> 00:38:33,352
(Phantom Thief N) Well, well~

881
00:38:33,436 --> 00:38:35,938
Butt Detective's here too~

882
00:38:36,022 --> 00:38:37,815
(Phantom Thief G)
What are you doing here?

883
00:38:37,898 --> 00:38:40,651
I dismissed you two already.

884
00:38:40,735 --> 00:38:43,320
And it's been a load
off our backs, thanks.

885
00:38:43,821 --> 00:38:45,656
We joined this outfit
'cause they said

886
00:38:45,740 --> 00:38:47,700
we'd get in on
some good fights,

887
00:38:47,783 --> 00:38:50,244
but all you do
is pick on kids.

888
00:38:50,327 --> 00:38:53,039
(Phantom Thief N) You were just gonna
have the G-Squad erase us anyway.

889
00:38:53,664 --> 00:38:54,373
Heh...

890
00:38:54,457 --> 00:38:56,876
Then we'll just
knock you flat first.

891
00:38:56,959 --> 00:38:58,335
Phantom Thief G.

892
00:38:58,419 --> 00:39:01,130
(Butt Detective)
Phantom Thief Z, Phantom Thief N—

893
00:39:01,630 --> 00:39:04,300
I take it we can count
you as allies, for now?

894
00:39:04,383 --> 00:39:06,260
Take it however you want.

895
00:39:06,344 --> 00:39:08,346
Once we're done with him,
you're next.

896
00:39:09,055 --> 00:39:09,930
Grr!

897
00:39:12,475 --> 00:39:15,853
The enemy of yesterday,
a friend today?

898
00:39:15,936 --> 00:39:17,396
How pointless.

899
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:20,524
The only one I
need is Butt Detective.

900
00:39:20,608 --> 00:39:22,610
The rest of you
can disappear.

901
00:39:23,903 --> 00:39:27,740
(Phantom Thief Z) Raaaargh~!

902
00:39:27,823 --> 00:39:29,116
Raaah~!

903
00:39:29,200 --> 00:39:30,159
(Phantom Thief G) Heheh.

904
00:39:30,242 --> 00:39:33,704
(Impact sound)

905
00:39:33,788 --> 00:39:34,663
Hm?

906
00:39:34,747 --> 00:39:35,790
Heh.

907
00:39:36,499 --> 00:39:38,042
That won't work.

908
00:39:38,125 --> 00:39:39,085
What?!

909
00:39:39,794 --> 00:39:40,836
Hah... ngh.

910
00:39:40,920 --> 00:39:42,171
Phantom Thief Z.

911
00:39:42,254 --> 00:39:44,048
Please, keep that
attack up.

912
00:39:44,131 --> 00:39:46,175
Didn't need you
to tell me.

913
00:39:46,258 --> 00:39:47,009
Hyah!

914
00:39:47,093 --> 00:39:48,219
(Phantom Thief N) Sticky-Band!

915
00:39:48,302 --> 00:39:49,553
Gngh...

916
00:39:50,846 --> 00:39:52,223
(Phantom Thief G) Wha—! Ungh.

917
00:39:52,306 --> 00:39:53,682
(Phantom Thief N) Gotcha~

918
00:39:53,766 --> 00:39:54,809
(Phantom Thief Z) Raah!

919
00:39:54,892 --> 00:39:56,435
Ngh!

920
00:39:56,519 --> 00:39:57,603
Hyah!

921
00:39:57,686 --> 00:39:58,938
Hah!

922
00:39:59,021 --> 00:40:00,231
Ngh!

923
00:40:02,400 --> 00:40:04,026
-(Phantom Thief G) Huh?
-(Butt Detective) Hm.

924
00:40:04,527 --> 00:40:05,444
(Phantom Thief Z) Huh?

925
00:40:05,528 --> 00:40:07,405
(Phantom Thief G) What are
you doing, Phantom Thief S?!

926
00:40:07,488 --> 00:40:08,364
Ah!

927
00:40:08,447 --> 00:40:10,866
I'll just steal every
eye in the place.

928
00:40:10,950 --> 00:40:12,201
Eyes on Mii!

929
00:40:12,284 --> 00:40:13,077
Huh?

930
00:40:15,621 --> 00:40:18,582
Daz—zle-Star!!

931
00:40:19,750 --> 00:40:20,334
(Phantom Thief Z) Ngh...

932
00:40:20,418 --> 00:40:21,794
Whoa~!

933
00:40:22,711 --> 00:40:24,463
M-my eyes...

934
00:40:24,964 --> 00:40:27,133
You two, take this too!

935
00:40:28,008 --> 00:40:30,845
(Both) Ugh... ngh...

936
00:40:30,928 --> 00:40:32,096
(Koala) Butt Detective!

937
00:40:32,179 --> 00:40:33,931
(Brown) Are you all right?

938
00:40:34,014 --> 00:40:37,518
Looks like you've been
dazzled by Mii's charm.

939
00:40:37,601 --> 00:40:39,103
Goooood! Good!

940
00:40:39,186 --> 00:40:40,813
(Phantom Thief Z) Unnngh...

941
00:40:40,896 --> 00:40:42,565
Star Spin—

942
00:40:43,065 --> 00:40:44,108
—Attack!

943
00:40:44,942 --> 00:40:45,943
(Phantom Thief Z) Guhah!

944
00:40:46,944 --> 00:40:48,654
Ugh... guh...

945
00:40:50,239 --> 00:40:52,158
(Idol hopefuls) Ahh~

946
00:40:52,658 --> 00:40:54,869
(Phantom Thief G) Those two
are getting in the way.

947
00:40:54,952 --> 00:40:56,662
Shadow G!

948
00:40:57,413 --> 00:40:59,832
(G-Squad)
*skitter skitter, skitter skitter*...

949
00:41:00,624 --> 00:41:01,584
Ah...

950
00:41:01,667 --> 00:41:03,460
Hey, N, get those two!

951
00:41:03,544 --> 00:41:06,505
(Phantom Thief N)
You're an idiot, Z. Fine, fine.

952
00:41:06,589 --> 00:41:07,715
Disappear.

953
00:41:07,798 --> 00:41:10,801
(G-Squad)
*skitter skitter, skitter skitter*...

954
00:41:10,885 --> 00:41:12,219
(Brown & Koala) Whoa!

955
00:41:18,517 --> 00:41:20,686
-(Phantom Thief Z) Guaahh...
-(Koala & Brown) Hm?

956
00:41:21,520 --> 00:41:22,521
(All three) Ah...

957
00:41:22,605 --> 00:41:24,732
(Phantom Thief N & Phantom Thief Z)
Haah... haah...

958
00:41:24,815 --> 00:41:25,816
(All three) Ah!

959
00:41:25,900 --> 00:41:27,443
Wh-why...?

960
00:41:27,526 --> 00:41:29,278
Who knows.

961
00:41:29,361 --> 00:41:32,448
Guess it's 'cause
you two are just kids.

962
00:41:32,531 --> 00:41:33,616
(Phantom Thief N) Ha, that's rich~

963
00:41:33,699 --> 00:41:35,159
(Phantom Thief Z) Uaahh...

964
00:41:36,785 --> 00:41:38,996
(Butt Detective)
Phantom Thief Z! Phantom Thief N!

965
00:41:39,079 --> 00:41:40,706
How pointless.

966
00:41:41,540 --> 00:41:42,374
Hm...

967
00:41:43,542 --> 00:41:45,085
(Phantom Thief K) With this
many crawling around,

968
00:41:45,169 --> 00:41:47,379
there's no tellin'
which one's the Master.

969
00:41:47,463 --> 00:41:50,591
Star Lariat!

970
00:41:50,674 --> 00:41:53,135
Star Reverse Crab Hold!

971
00:41:53,761 --> 00:41:55,679
Star Backdrop!

972
00:41:56,305 --> 00:41:58,432
Star Headlock!

973
00:42:02,061 --> 00:42:03,729
{\an8}Found it.

974
00:42:03,812 --> 00:42:05,731
{\an8}I've already planted
the program.

975
00:42:05,814 --> 00:42:08,317
{\an8}All that's left is
plugging in the cable.

976
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:09,151
{\an8}(Phantom Thief K & Phantom Thief U) Right.

977
00:42:14,073 --> 00:42:15,074
(Master Catchbot) VERY WELL.

978
00:42:15,157 --> 00:42:16,742
LET US PLAY.

979
00:42:19,995 --> 00:42:21,330
You robot punk!

980
00:42:21,413 --> 00:42:23,666
Take my brand-new
finishing move!

981
00:42:23,749 --> 00:42:25,626
Death Spring!!

982
00:42:26,961 --> 00:42:28,212
INEFFECTIVE.

983
00:42:29,213 --> 00:42:30,547
Ah! Ka~!

984
00:42:31,924 --> 00:42:33,884
Now! Now's the time!

985
00:42:33,968 --> 00:42:35,344
I know!

986
00:42:37,554 --> 00:42:38,722
Ahh...

987
00:42:39,431 --> 00:42:40,182
(Thud)
(Phantom Thief K) Ka-ha!

988
00:42:40,266 --> 00:42:41,642
{\an8}(Cider & Cola) It stopped!

989
00:42:41,725 --> 00:42:43,102
{\an8}It worked!

990
00:42:43,185 --> 00:42:45,646
{\an8}(Resistance members)
Ohh! Ha ha ha ha!

991
00:42:45,729 --> 00:42:48,941
Star Spin—Attack!

992
00:42:49,608 --> 00:42:51,735
(Butt Detective) Hyah! Hyah!

993
00:42:53,153 --> 00:42:55,823
Just gonna keep running,
Butt Detective?

994
00:42:55,906 --> 00:42:59,368
No—your biggest attack

995
00:42:59,451 --> 00:43:01,704
is exactly the biggest
chance for a counterattack.

996
00:43:01,787 --> 00:43:03,789
(Phantom Thief S)
Talking a big game, huh.

997
00:43:04,373 --> 00:43:06,208
Maximum output.

998
00:43:08,127 --> 00:43:11,005
Pri-Brown,
your hair's a mess.

999
00:43:11,088 --> 00:43:11,964
Huh?

1000
00:43:12,506 --> 00:43:14,008
Daz—

1001
00:43:14,091 --> 00:43:15,467
(Brown) Mm~

1002
00:43:15,551 --> 00:43:16,594
Oh, this!

1003
00:43:16,677 --> 00:43:18,012
—zle-Star!!

1004
00:43:20,514 --> 00:43:23,309
-(Phantom Thief S) Whoa!!
-(Phantom Thief G) Waahh...

1005
00:43:23,392 --> 00:43:26,687
(Butt Detective) If you'll
excuse me... down you go.

1006
00:43:28,856 --> 00:43:30,649
(Phantom Thief S) Whoa-aah!

1007
00:43:31,442 --> 00:43:32,610
(Phantom Thief G) It won't work.

1008
00:43:34,653 --> 00:43:36,739
I said it won't work—

1009
00:43:42,870 --> 00:43:45,581
(Butt Detective) Phantom Thief Z's
attack made it clear.

1010
00:43:45,664 --> 00:43:47,166
Your true identity.

1011
00:43:47,666 --> 00:43:48,792
Ss~

1012
00:43:52,087 --> 00:43:53,088
Ss~

1013
00:43:53,172 --> 00:43:56,050
Pfffbbt pfffbbt...

1014
00:43:56,133 --> 00:43:59,470
Pfffbbt pffffbbt...

1015
00:43:59,553 --> 00:44:03,265
Pfffbbt pfffbbt pffffbbt!

1016
00:44:06,268 --> 00:44:06,810
Hah!

1017
00:44:07,686 --> 00:44:08,437
Pwoo!

1018
00:44:14,318 --> 00:44:17,071
(Phantom Thief K) Ka-ha!
Wait, why's the elevator—?

1019
00:44:17,154 --> 00:44:19,782
(Phantom Thief U)
That light—that's him.

1020
00:44:19,865 --> 00:44:22,868
(Phantom Thief U) Everyone, quick,
grab onto a Catchbot!

1021
00:44:27,706 --> 00:44:29,875
You've been a great help.

1022
00:44:29,958 --> 00:44:30,751
Thank you.

1023
00:44:30,834 --> 00:44:31,335
What?

1024
00:44:34,004 --> 00:44:35,089
Okay.

1025
00:44:35,172 --> 00:44:37,132
Mii will go do what
Mii's gotta do.

1026
00:44:38,675 --> 00:44:40,636
See you again.

1027
00:44:42,596 --> 00:44:45,057
Once you find the man
with the butt face,

1028
00:44:45,140 --> 00:44:47,643
bring him aboard and
come back to me.

1029
00:44:48,560 --> 00:44:49,853
UNDERSTOOD.

1030
00:44:49,937 --> 00:44:51,980
Good. Now, send
the Catchbots

1031
00:44:52,064 --> 00:44:54,066
flying straight
toward that light.

1032
00:44:54,149 --> 00:44:56,110
Already given the order.

1033
00:45:03,242 --> 00:45:05,160
Well, that worked out.

1034
00:45:05,244 --> 00:45:07,162
Because I'm a genius,
that's why. Hee hee!

1035
00:45:07,246 --> 00:45:09,873
Hey! Shouldn't we
be hurrying up—

1036
00:45:10,874 --> 00:45:12,835
—to the surface, to escape?

1037
00:45:12,918 --> 00:45:15,462
(Phantom Thief U) Heheh. I've been
waiting for this exact moment.

1038
00:45:15,546 --> 00:45:17,256
(Phantom Thief I) I'm coming too.

1039
00:45:17,339 --> 00:45:18,132
Huh?

1040
00:45:18,632 --> 00:45:20,342
Argh, my gut's telling me—

1041
00:45:20,426 --> 00:45:22,761
—to stick with you two!

1042
00:45:22,845 --> 00:45:25,639
(Master Catchbot)
PROCEEDING TO THE G-SHUTTLE.

1043
00:45:29,476 --> 00:45:31,770
(G-Squad) *skitter-skiss~!*

1044
00:45:33,647 --> 00:45:37,109
Hmmm. So it
really was armor.

1045
00:45:37,192 --> 00:45:38,944
Inside, the G-Squad,

1046
00:45:39,027 --> 00:45:41,071
and the one controlling it—

1047
00:45:41,155 --> 00:45:41,864
(Phantom Thief G) —was me.

1048
00:45:42,614 --> 00:45:44,032
Using the G-Squad,

1049
00:45:44,116 --> 00:45:47,161
you were wearing a
false form all along.

1050
00:45:47,244 --> 00:45:48,078
Phantom Thief G.

1051
00:45:48,162 --> 00:45:51,415
I'm about to take
the entire world for myself.

1052
00:45:51,498 --> 00:45:53,709
As long as the
Dark Age Plan moves forward,

1053
00:45:53,792 --> 00:45:56,336
consider the whole
world in danger.

1054
00:45:56,420 --> 00:45:57,796
Mmph!

1055
00:45:57,880 --> 00:45:59,798
(Phantom Thief G) If you want
to stop me, come after me!

1056
00:45:59,882 --> 00:46:00,716
(Staff) Oop!

1057
00:46:02,050 --> 00:46:04,386
(Butt Detective) Those eyes...
so it really is you.

1058
00:46:04,470 --> 00:46:06,930
(Staff) Ehehe.
Well done, all of you.

1059
00:46:07,431 --> 00:46:10,142
I've been waiting for
this exact chance.

1060
00:46:10,642 --> 00:46:11,143
Heheh.

1061
00:46:11,226 --> 00:46:12,352
(Brown) Phantom Thief B!

1062
00:46:14,229 --> 00:46:16,064
(Phantom Thief S) Butt Detective!

1063
00:46:16,148 --> 00:46:18,400
You bent Mii's
nose this crooked,

1064
00:46:18,484 --> 00:46:22,196
and you think you'll get
off scot-free~?!

1065
00:46:22,279 --> 00:46:22,946
Guhah!

1066
00:46:23,030 --> 00:46:24,072
Ow ow ow ow!

1067
00:46:24,156 --> 00:46:26,158
Ha! Even more
crooked now!

1068
00:46:26,241 --> 00:46:26,784
Who's that?

1069
00:46:26,867 --> 00:46:28,994
(Cola) You fake Star Mabushi!

1070
00:46:29,077 --> 00:46:32,206
Time to pay for using
our dreams against us!

1071
00:46:32,289 --> 00:46:32,873
(Cider & Cola) Hyah!

1072
00:46:32,956 --> 00:46:35,334
Bursting Soda! Cider!

1073
00:46:35,417 --> 00:46:37,795
Fizzing Soda! Cola!

1074
00:46:38,879 --> 00:46:39,588
(Phantom Thief S) Ngh...

1075
00:46:39,671 --> 00:46:41,423
Star Spin!

1076
00:46:42,633 --> 00:46:45,385
(Both) The forbidden
special mixed drink—

1077
00:46:45,469 --> 00:46:47,221
—Attack!

1078
00:46:47,304 --> 00:46:48,388
(Phantom Thief S) Noooo!

1079
00:46:48,972 --> 00:46:50,766
Ungh... guhah...

1080
00:46:50,849 --> 00:46:51,725
Ka-boom~

1081
00:46:53,477 --> 00:46:55,187
Fizzy and fabulous,
that's us!

1082
00:46:56,480 --> 00:46:58,190
The name's Star Mabushi.

1083
00:46:58,899 --> 00:47:00,234
Cola!

1084
00:47:01,235 --> 00:47:02,444
(Cola) Koala!

1085
00:47:02,528 --> 00:47:03,946
Thank goodness
you're safe.

1086
00:47:04,446 --> 00:47:05,864
You too, Cider.

1087
00:47:07,658 --> 00:47:10,869
You're the real
Star Mabushi, aren't you?

1088
00:47:10,953 --> 00:47:11,870
Yes indeed!

1089
00:47:11,954 --> 00:47:13,580
I know I don't look
much like my poster,

1090
00:47:13,664 --> 00:47:15,541
but working down
here all this time

1091
00:47:15,624 --> 00:47:17,042
toughened me right up.

1092
00:47:17,125 --> 00:47:20,796
Was it you two who opened
that hole to the surface?

1093
00:47:20,879 --> 00:47:22,965
Thanks to that,
I made it back.

1094
00:47:23,048 --> 00:47:24,508
Mister, um...

1095
00:47:24,591 --> 00:47:26,969
{\an8}This is Butt Detective.

1096
00:47:27,052 --> 00:47:28,470
{\an8}(Resistance members)
Butt Detective!

1097
00:47:29,179 --> 00:47:30,806
Butt Detective.

1098
00:47:31,306 --> 00:47:32,933
(Catchbot)
BUTT-FACED MAN DETECTED.

1099
00:47:33,016 --> 00:47:34,434
PLEASE, CLIMB ABOARD.

1100
00:47:34,518 --> 00:47:35,394
Hm?

1101
00:47:37,062 --> 00:47:39,439
(Butt Detective)
I thought you might come.

1102
00:47:40,065 --> 00:47:42,067
(Butt Detective) Then I'll
take you up on that.

1103
00:47:42,150 --> 00:47:45,153
This case isn't
solved yet, after all.

1104
00:47:45,237 --> 00:47:46,238
Right.

1105
00:47:46,321 --> 00:47:48,574
There are still people
trapped down here.

1106
00:47:48,657 --> 00:47:50,951
Leave that to
Mii and the others!

1107
00:47:51,034 --> 00:47:51,910
-(Cola) Leave it to us!
-(Brown) Hm?

1108
00:47:52,619 --> 00:47:53,579
(Resistance members) Yeah.

1109
00:47:53,662 --> 00:47:55,205
(Butt Detective) Koala,
please—

1110
00:47:55,289 --> 00:47:57,791
—report all of this
to Chief Maltese.

1111
00:47:57,875 --> 00:47:58,375
Got it.

1112
00:47:58,458 --> 00:48:00,669
I'm going after Phantom Thief G,

1113
00:48:00,752 --> 00:48:03,130
to stop the Dark Age Plan.

1114
00:48:03,213 --> 00:48:04,464
(Brown) I'm coming too!

1115
00:48:04,965 --> 00:48:06,216
I'm scared, but—

1116
00:48:06,300 --> 00:48:06,842
Whoa!

1117
00:48:09,136 --> 00:48:10,804
(Star) Good luck! Cool guy.

1118
00:48:13,849 --> 00:48:16,351
(Phantom Thief S) Ugh... unh...

1119
00:48:17,060 --> 00:48:18,937
(Star) You used to be
a regular at the contest—

1120
00:48:19,021 --> 00:48:20,772
Chaku Isogin, wasn't it?

1121
00:48:21,273 --> 00:48:22,482
That's right.

1122
00:48:22,566 --> 00:48:26,069
The guy who challenged you a
hundred times, and you never once
acknowledged.

1123
00:48:26,737 --> 00:48:29,281
Where there's a winner,
there's a loser.

1124
00:48:29,781 --> 00:48:31,450
If you can accept
a hundred defeats

1125
00:48:31,533 --> 00:48:33,577
and still find it in
you to face forward,

1126
00:48:34,536 --> 00:48:36,830
then more than anyone,
you'll understand

1127
00:48:36,914 --> 00:48:39,499
the hearts of others, and you'll
run toward your dream again.

1128
00:48:40,083 --> 00:48:41,960
Chaaak~

1129
00:48:49,301 --> 00:48:52,220
Right. Phantom Thief I—
could it be that—

1130
00:48:52,846 --> 00:48:55,307
I thought the
resemblance was there too.

1131
00:48:55,390 --> 00:48:58,936
Brown's twin sister, separated
from him when they were young—

1132
00:48:59,019 --> 00:49:00,646
you're Ivory, aren't you?

1133
00:49:01,146 --> 00:49:01,938
Yes.

1134
00:49:02,856 --> 00:49:05,442
Back then, the only
place we had

1135
00:49:05,525 --> 00:49:07,361
was a cardboard box.

1136
00:49:07,861 --> 00:49:10,030
And then, a lot happened...

1137
00:49:11,031 --> 00:49:13,825
(Ivory) Brown, is becoming
a police officer your dream?

1138
00:49:13,909 --> 00:49:14,409
(Brown) Huh?

1139
00:49:14,493 --> 00:49:15,285
(Ivory) As for me,

1140
00:49:15,369 --> 00:49:17,954
I figured out what
I really want to do.

1141
00:49:18,038 --> 00:49:19,915
That's why I decided—

1142
00:49:19,998 --> 00:49:21,375
—to work here,
at the G Invention Lab.

1143
00:49:21,458 --> 00:49:25,128
(Brown) Inventions that make
the world more interesting?

1144
00:49:25,212 --> 00:49:26,963
(Ivory) That's my dream.

1145
00:49:27,047 --> 00:49:28,090
Because I'm a genius,
that's why.

1146
00:49:28,715 --> 00:49:31,468
Ivory, will we
see each other again?

1147
00:49:31,551 --> 00:49:32,594
Of course we will.

1148
00:49:32,678 --> 00:49:34,805
Because we're family.

1149
00:49:34,888 --> 00:49:37,766
Eheheh. Heheh.

1150
00:49:44,356 --> 00:49:46,274
If it really is Ivory,

1151
00:49:46,358 --> 00:49:49,069
I'll catch her and give
her a good talking-to.

1152
00:49:49,152 --> 00:49:50,487
As her big brother.

1153
00:49:50,570 --> 00:49:54,324
Whoaaa~!

1154
00:49:55,409 --> 00:49:57,035
(Phantom Thief U) Ram it
straight into the G-Shuttle!

1155
00:49:57,119 --> 00:49:58,704
(Master Catchbot) UNDERSTOOD.

1156
00:49:59,454 --> 00:50:00,330
(Phantom Thief U and co.) Ah!

1157
00:50:04,584 --> 00:50:05,585
(Phantom Thief K) Wha—!

1158
00:50:05,669 --> 00:50:07,546
(Master Catchbot)
CONTROL... NOT POSSIBLE.

1159
00:50:10,007 --> 00:50:10,757
Ah—

1160
00:50:10,841 --> 00:50:11,842
(Phantom Thief T)
I told you already.

1161
00:50:12,342 --> 00:50:15,012
Anyone who interferes
with the Dark Age Plan—

1162
00:50:15,512 --> 00:50:16,012
—gets cut down!

1163
00:50:18,306 --> 00:50:19,057
(Phantom Thief U) Ungh...

1164
00:50:21,935 --> 00:50:22,811
Ngh...

1165
00:50:25,814 --> 00:50:27,649
(Phantom Thief T) So you've
finally shown your true colors,

1166
00:50:27,733 --> 00:50:28,984
Phantom Thief U!

1167
00:50:29,067 --> 00:50:29,901
(Phantom Thief U) Ungh...

1168
00:50:29,985 --> 00:50:32,279
(Phantom Thief Q) We're not
handing over the Moonlight Stone.

1169
00:50:32,362 --> 00:50:33,822
Phantom Thief H, too.

1170
00:50:33,905 --> 00:50:35,032
Even Phantom Thief Q.

1171
00:50:35,115 --> 00:50:38,827
(Phantom Thief T) The Moonlight Stone is
essential to the Dark Age Plan.

1172
00:50:38,910 --> 00:50:41,163
World domination, led
by the phantom thieves—

1173
00:50:41,246 --> 00:50:42,956
we won't let you interfere!

1174
00:50:43,039 --> 00:50:44,875
Pump-up complete!

1175
00:50:44,958 --> 00:50:47,294
Guess there's nothin'
for it but to fight!

1176
00:50:47,377 --> 00:50:48,628
Guess so.

1177
00:50:48,712 --> 00:50:49,212
(Phantom Thief K) Kaa!

1178
00:50:49,296 --> 00:50:51,131
Death Spring!!

1179
00:50:53,133 --> 00:50:55,052
Dodged with room to spare.

1180
00:50:55,135 --> 00:50:56,011
(Phantom Thief U) Here!

1181
00:50:57,929 --> 00:51:00,432
Something Berry
packed for me.

1182
00:51:00,515 --> 00:51:02,142
Right, leave it to me.

1183
00:51:03,685 --> 00:51:04,436
Huh?

1184
00:51:05,979 --> 00:51:06,855
Wait, what?

1185
00:51:07,689 --> 00:51:11,151
Feast your eyes
on my power!

1186
00:51:11,693 --> 00:51:13,236
Ka-haa~!

1187
00:51:13,904 --> 00:51:15,989
Ka-ha... ka~

1188
00:51:16,490 --> 00:51:18,158
It's all empty.

1189
00:51:18,658 --> 00:51:22,412
And on top of that,
this is sleeping spray.

1190
00:51:22,496 --> 00:51:23,205
Ka-ha...

1191
00:51:23,288 --> 00:51:25,415
(Phantom Thief T)
Traitors get cut down too!

1192
00:51:25,499 --> 00:51:26,833
-(Phantom Thief I) Ah!
-(Phantom Thief U) I!

1193
00:51:27,417 --> 00:51:28,168
(Phantom Thief U) Hah!

1194
00:51:29,044 --> 00:51:29,795
Ah!

1195
00:51:30,295 --> 00:51:31,755
Ngh! Guh...

1196
00:51:32,255 --> 00:51:35,008
Guess I shouldn't try
things I'm not used to.

1197
00:51:35,092 --> 00:51:35,717
Ungh...

1198
00:51:35,801 --> 00:51:37,177
(Phantom Thief I) Whoaa...

1199
00:51:37,260 --> 00:51:39,596
(Phantom Thief T) A candle
flickering in the wind.

1200
00:51:39,679 --> 00:51:40,889
—Phantom Thief U.

1201
00:51:40,972 --> 00:51:43,600
Allow me to snuff
that flame out.

1202
00:51:43,683 --> 00:51:46,561
Mmm, how marvelous.

1203
00:51:47,062 --> 00:51:48,313
Perfect timing.

1204
00:51:48,396 --> 00:51:49,481
(Phantom Thief T and co.) Hm?

1205
00:51:49,564 --> 00:51:51,024
Whoa~!

1206
00:51:51,108 --> 00:51:53,026
(Phantom Thief U) Butt Detective,
my boy.

1207
00:51:53,110 --> 00:51:54,986
(Butt Detective) Phantom Thief U.

1208
00:51:56,988 --> 00:51:58,907
(Phantom Thief U) So glad
you made it back.

1209
00:51:58,990 --> 00:51:59,866
(Phantom Thief I) Well done.

1210
00:51:59,950 --> 00:52:00,867
(Catchbot 1) YES.

1211
00:52:03,286 --> 00:52:04,496
(Brown) Thank you.

1212
00:52:05,997 --> 00:52:08,333
Let me get straight
to the point.

1213
00:52:08,834 --> 00:52:09,376
With me—

1214
00:52:09,459 --> 00:52:11,378
—join forces, you mean?

1215
00:52:11,461 --> 00:52:13,088
W-with a phantom thief?

1216
00:52:13,171 --> 00:52:14,130
B-but why—

1217
00:52:14,214 --> 00:52:16,466
To solve this case,

1218
00:52:16,550 --> 00:52:19,135
it might just be our
best option right now.

1219
00:52:19,219 --> 00:52:19,845
Huh?

1220
00:52:19,928 --> 00:52:22,055
He said the Dark Age Plan

1221
00:52:22,139 --> 00:52:25,725
needs both the
Moonlight Stone and me.

1222
00:52:25,809 --> 00:52:28,061
If we leave the Phantom
Thief Academy be,

1223
00:52:28,144 --> 00:52:30,355
we'll keep being targeted.

1224
00:52:30,438 --> 00:52:31,565
And so will the world...

1225
00:52:31,648 --> 00:52:33,275
That's about the size of it.

1226
00:52:33,358 --> 00:52:36,069
Oh, by the way, Phantom Thief I—

1227
00:52:36,152 --> 00:52:39,114
aren't you my little
sister, Ivory?

1228
00:52:39,197 --> 00:52:39,739
(Phantom Thief I) Huh?

1229
00:52:40,824 --> 00:52:41,867
Ngh...

1230
00:52:42,534 --> 00:52:44,494
No idea. Who's that?

1231
00:52:44,578 --> 00:52:46,454
(Brown) Playing
dumb, are we?

1232
00:52:46,538 --> 00:52:48,206
I can tell just by
looking at your face!

1233
00:52:48,290 --> 00:52:48,790
*squish*

1234
00:52:50,166 --> 00:52:52,669
(Phantom Thief I)
Gyaah! What are you doing?!

1235
00:52:52,752 --> 00:52:54,629
(Startup sound)
(Brown) Whoa!

1236
00:52:54,713 --> 00:52:57,799
(Announcement) G-SHUTTLE
LAUNCH PREPARATIONS, COMMENCING.

1237
00:52:57,883 --> 00:52:58,925
(Brown) What,
what's happening?

1238
00:52:59,009 --> 00:53:01,011
(Phantom Thief I) The G-Shuttle
just powered up.

1239
00:53:01,511 --> 00:53:03,013
(Phantom Thief T)
The Dark Age Plan—

1240
00:53:03,096 --> 00:53:04,931
—is finally
beginning, Boss?

1241
00:53:05,015 --> 00:53:06,600
(Phantom Thief G) That's right.

1242
00:53:06,683 --> 00:53:08,143
Launch the G-Shuttle—

1243
00:53:08,226 --> 00:53:10,395
—the time has come
to claim the world.

1244
00:53:10,478 --> 00:53:12,105
Whoaaa~!

1245
00:53:16,359 --> 00:53:17,569
(Phantom Thief T) Who's that?

1246
00:53:18,278 --> 00:53:20,280
You two didn't know?

1247
00:53:20,780 --> 00:53:23,283
That's what
Phantom Thief G looked like

1248
00:53:23,366 --> 00:53:24,868
back when I was
with the Academy.

1249
00:53:25,368 --> 00:53:28,413
That golden body was
armor all along.

1250
00:53:28,496 --> 00:53:29,080
{\an8}(Phantom Thief Q) No way!

1251
00:53:29,164 --> 00:53:31,458
{\an8}We took orders from
that little guy?

1252
00:53:31,541 --> 00:53:33,251
{\an8}How many grams
does he even weigh?

1253
00:53:33,335 --> 00:53:35,420
Sorry for being small.

1254
00:53:35,503 --> 00:53:39,507
Twisting a bunch of prejudiced
fools around my finger? Child's play.

1255
00:53:39,591 --> 00:53:41,968
What matters is
what's in here.

1256
00:53:42,052 --> 00:53:46,473
(G-Squad) *skitter skitter,
skitter skitter, skitter skitter*...

1257
00:53:48,975 --> 00:53:50,894
(Phantom Thief G) Now that
Butt Detective has arrived,

1258
00:53:50,977 --> 00:53:52,938
my victory is assured.

1259
00:53:53,021 --> 00:53:54,898
The Moonlight Stone is fuel!

1260
00:53:54,981 --> 00:53:57,233
As my thruster engine,

1261
00:53:57,317 --> 00:54:01,029
you'll spend the rest of your
life orbiting this planet.

1262
00:54:01,112 --> 00:54:03,907
Now, climb aboard
the G-Shuttle.

1263
00:54:03,990 --> 00:54:05,867
I'll have to decline.

1264
00:54:05,951 --> 00:54:07,452
Figured you'd say that.

1265
00:54:07,535 --> 00:54:09,829
Then how about this?

1266
00:54:09,913 --> 00:54:11,206
(All four) Hm?

1267
00:54:13,083 --> 00:54:14,417
(Master) Whoa!!

1268
00:54:14,501 --> 00:54:16,086
(Suzu) What's going
on all of a sudden?

1269
00:54:16,169 --> 00:54:18,672
(Customer) What kind of
sanitation are you running here?!

1270
00:54:18,755 --> 00:54:19,673
(Penguin Hanako) Ehehe.

1271
00:54:19,756 --> 00:54:20,507
(G-Squad) *skitter skitter*...

1272
00:54:20,590 --> 00:54:22,133
-(Penguin Hanako) Kyaaah!
-(Penguin Taro) Wha—!

1273
00:54:22,217 --> 00:54:23,885
-(G-Squad) *skitter skitter*
-(Midori) Hm?

1274
00:54:23,969 --> 00:54:25,136
Gyaah!

1275
00:54:25,220 --> 00:54:27,055
(Reporter) About this
G infestation problem—

1276
00:54:27,138 --> 00:54:28,556
don't you have an
apology to make?

1277
00:54:29,057 --> 00:54:30,600
(Beni Imoko) We are
terribly sorry.

1278
00:54:30,684 --> 00:54:31,559
(Reporter) Just an apology?!

1279
00:54:31,643 --> 00:54:33,103
{\an8}(Brown) Ahhh...

1280
00:54:35,063 --> 00:54:36,898
I've just confirmed something.

1281
00:54:37,399 --> 00:54:41,236
The truth hidden inside
the Dark Age Plan.

1282
00:54:41,319 --> 00:54:42,946
Truth?

1283
00:54:43,029 --> 00:54:45,323
Try rearranging
the letters.

1284
00:54:45,824 --> 00:54:47,450
It's simple wordplay.

1285
00:54:47,534 --> 00:54:49,494
"Dark Age"...

1286
00:54:49,577 --> 00:54:50,537
Hm~

1287
00:54:51,663 --> 00:54:53,415
...rearranged: just
"G, everywhere."

1288
00:54:53,498 --> 00:54:54,958
That's right.

1289
00:54:55,041 --> 00:54:57,627
Filling the entire world
with the G-Squad,

1290
00:54:57,711 --> 00:54:59,796
and standing atop
every living thing—

1291
00:54:59,879 --> 00:55:01,089
—that's my true objective.

1292
00:55:01,172 --> 00:55:03,300
So from the very start,

1293
00:55:03,383 --> 00:55:05,885
you never meant to take
us aboard the G-Shuttle.

1294
00:55:05,969 --> 00:55:07,053
None at all.

1295
00:55:07,137 --> 00:55:10,223
You're nothing more than
a means of making money.

1296
00:55:10,890 --> 00:55:12,642
And you're even
smaller on the inside!

1297
00:55:12,726 --> 00:55:15,186
Then what were we
even working for?!

1298
00:55:15,270 --> 00:55:16,313
Grrr~!

1299
00:55:16,396 --> 00:55:17,772
Shadow G!

1300
00:55:17,856 --> 00:55:18,982
(All three) Huh?

1301
00:55:19,482 --> 00:55:21,735
-(Phantom Thief Q) Ew, ew, gross!
-(Phantom Thief H) Yikes!

1302
00:55:26,197 --> 00:55:27,991
(Phantom Thief G)
The Phantom Thief Academy

1303
00:55:28,074 --> 00:55:29,576
was just a stepping stone.

1304
00:55:29,659 --> 00:55:32,329
At this rate,
Suzu and everyone—

1305
00:55:32,412 --> 00:55:34,331
It's not just them.

1306
00:55:34,414 --> 00:55:37,292
The same thing is about to
happen all over the world.

1307
00:55:39,085 --> 00:55:42,338
That's right. Let's start
with the one closest to you—

1308
00:55:42,422 --> 00:55:44,090
—Brown.

1309
00:55:44,174 --> 00:55:45,050
Hngh!

1310
00:55:45,133 --> 00:55:46,384
Shadow G!

1311
00:55:47,552 --> 00:55:48,887
Whoaaa!

1312
00:55:48,970 --> 00:55:51,514
I-I'm fine! Really!

1313
00:55:51,598 --> 00:55:54,476
Please, whatever happens,
don't get on that shuttle!

1314
00:55:54,559 --> 00:55:56,144
Butt Detective!

1315
00:55:57,687 --> 00:55:58,605
(Butt Detective) Ngh...

1316
00:55:58,688 --> 00:56:01,316
Now, get aboard.

1317
00:56:01,399 --> 00:56:03,109
(Butt Detective) Ungh...

1318
00:56:03,610 --> 00:56:05,987
(Brown) Ungghhh...

1319
00:56:06,071 --> 00:56:07,489
(Butt Detective) Ungh...

1320
00:56:14,120 --> 00:56:14,954
(Brown) Ah...

1321
00:56:15,038 --> 00:56:17,415
I said no~!

1322
00:56:18,083 --> 00:56:19,125
Hm...

1323
00:56:19,834 --> 00:56:21,086
(Phantom Thief G) Fuhahahaha!

1324
00:56:21,669 --> 00:56:23,713
To think a master
detective like you

1325
00:56:23,797 --> 00:56:26,091
would throw away your
life for the sake

1326
00:56:26,174 --> 00:56:28,551
of such a useless assistant.

1327
00:56:29,719 --> 00:56:32,013
He is not a
useless assistant.

1328
00:56:32,931 --> 00:56:35,725
He is my important partner.

1329
00:56:35,809 --> 00:56:37,018
(Both) Ah—

1330
00:56:37,102 --> 00:56:39,354
(Brown) Ungh...

1331
00:56:39,437 --> 00:56:40,939
(Phantom Thief G) Hmph! Heheh.

1332
00:56:41,022 --> 00:56:43,149
(Butt Detective)
It's all right, Brown.

1333
00:56:43,233 --> 00:56:45,777
Solving every case,
no matter what—

1334
00:56:45,860 --> 00:56:47,362
—that's my job, after all.

1335
00:56:48,029 --> 00:56:50,031
Butt Detective...

1336
00:56:50,115 --> 00:56:52,826
(Butt Detective) Besides,
Cola said it herself, didn't she—

1337
00:56:52,909 --> 00:56:56,287
that she'd never give up
on her dream, no matter what.

1338
00:56:56,371 --> 00:56:59,749
Never give up
on your dream...?

1339
00:57:03,878 --> 00:57:05,547
(Phantom Thief U)
That's exactly right.

1340
00:57:09,676 --> 00:57:10,176
(Both) Ah!

1341
00:57:11,719 --> 00:57:14,597
(Phantom Thief U) And I'm
not giving up either!

1342
00:57:21,980 --> 00:57:25,024
(Phantom Thief G) The time has come
for my dream to come true!

1343
00:57:25,108 --> 00:57:26,985
(Announcement)
COUNTDOWN, COMMENCING.

1344
00:57:27,485 --> 00:57:30,822
G-SHUTTLE LAUNCH
IN TEN SECONDS.

1345
00:57:31,322 --> 00:57:32,907
(Chief Maltese)
Wh-what in the world?

1346
00:57:33,408 --> 00:57:35,994
(Announcement) SIX. FIVE. FOUR.

1347
00:57:36,077 --> 00:57:39,330
THREE. TWO. ONE.

1348
00:57:39,414 --> 00:57:41,749
(Phantom Thief G) Fire!

1349
00:57:44,169 --> 00:57:44,752
(Both) Whoa!

1350
00:57:44,836 --> 00:57:46,629
Whoaaa~!

1351
00:57:46,713 --> 00:57:47,589
Ah!

1352
00:57:49,299 --> 00:57:52,010
Guaaahh...

1353
00:57:59,684 --> 00:58:00,643
(Chief Maltese) What's that?

1354
00:58:00,727 --> 00:58:02,061
(Bushy Brow)
A giant... G?

1355
00:58:02,854 --> 00:58:03,563
(Everyone) Huh?!

1356
00:58:03,646 --> 00:58:06,524
Gwaaah~!

1357
00:58:11,821 --> 00:58:14,574
(Announcement) G-SQUAD
DEPLOYMENT IN TEN MINUTES.

1358
00:58:16,618 --> 00:58:20,038
(Phantom Thief U) Heheh.
Not beautiful in the slightest.

1359
00:58:20,538 --> 00:58:21,831
So then, does this mean

1360
00:58:21,915 --> 00:58:24,167
the case is game over?

1361
00:58:24,250 --> 00:58:26,127
Ngh... unh...

1362
00:58:26,211 --> 00:58:29,964
I suppose so. To get
the Moonlight Stone back,

1363
00:58:30,048 --> 00:58:32,842
I'll need you to push
just a little bit harder.

1364
00:58:32,926 --> 00:58:34,761
(Ivory) Ngh... unh...

1365
00:58:34,844 --> 00:58:35,595
Hm?

1366
00:58:36,471 --> 00:58:38,389
It really is Ivory!

1367
00:58:38,473 --> 00:58:39,307
Ahh...

1368
00:58:39,390 --> 00:58:42,810
Hey, I want to
help Butt Detective.

1369
00:58:42,894 --> 00:58:45,063
Got any good ideas?

1370
00:58:45,146 --> 00:58:47,023
Ivory's a genius, right?

1371
00:58:47,106 --> 00:58:50,985
But the G-Shuttle's already
far off into the sky...

1372
00:58:51,069 --> 00:58:52,487
(Brown)
You can't give up!

1373
00:58:52,570 --> 00:58:54,906
Butt Detective said it too—

1374
00:58:54,989 --> 00:58:57,700
never give up on your
dream, no matter what.

1375
00:58:57,784 --> 00:58:59,160
Ah...

1376
00:59:00,995 --> 00:59:01,579
Hm.

1377
00:59:03,081 --> 00:59:04,666
Head for the control room.

1378
00:59:04,749 --> 00:59:05,792
Ah.

1379
00:59:06,793 --> 00:59:08,127
Get on, Ivory.

1380
00:59:11,256 --> 00:59:13,550
Haah... haah...

1381
00:59:13,633 --> 00:59:15,426
(Ivory) You okay?

1382
00:59:15,927 --> 00:59:16,970
I'm fine!

1383
00:59:17,053 --> 00:59:19,305
If I'm Pipi
Zhentan's partner,

1384
00:59:19,389 --> 00:59:21,349
then this much is nothing...

1385
00:59:23,226 --> 00:59:25,353
Come in, Phantom Thief U.

1386
00:59:25,436 --> 00:59:28,106
(Phantom Thief U) That voice—
Phantom Thief I, is that you?

1387
00:59:28,189 --> 00:59:29,857
What's the situation
right now?

1388
00:59:29,941 --> 00:59:31,317
Butt Detective—

1389
00:59:31,401 --> 00:59:33,778
—he's been wrung out
completely and can't move.

1390
00:59:33,861 --> 00:59:37,782
There's a food that'll get
Butt Detective back on his feet.

1391
00:59:37,865 --> 00:59:39,367
Head for the food storage!

1392
00:59:39,450 --> 00:59:42,870
(Announcement) G-SQUAD
DEPLOYMENT IN FIVE MINUTES.

1393
00:59:44,664 --> 00:59:46,791
Excellent! Found it.

1394
00:59:46,874 --> 00:59:49,002
Here, eat this.

1395
00:59:49,085 --> 00:59:51,004
Hm... this is...

1396
00:59:54,632 --> 00:59:56,301
From back then...

1397
01:00:01,222 --> 01:00:02,765
(Brown) Butt Detective!

1398
01:00:02,849 --> 01:00:05,059
Please, save the world!

1399
01:00:11,190 --> 01:00:13,985
Consider it... accepted.

1400
01:00:14,068 --> 01:00:15,945
(Brown) Yay~

1401
01:00:16,029 --> 01:00:16,821
(Butt Detective) Ngh...

1402
01:00:16,904 --> 01:00:17,697
(Brown) Ah...

1403
01:00:18,197 --> 01:00:19,407
(Butt Detective)
I'm all right.

1404
01:00:19,490 --> 01:00:20,950
(Phantom Thief U) Then, let's go.

1405
01:00:21,034 --> 01:00:21,951
(Butt Detective) Yes.

1406
01:00:22,452 --> 01:00:25,872
Let's smash the Dark
Age Plan to pieces.

1407
01:00:26,372 --> 01:00:28,833
How marvelous!

1408
01:00:32,670 --> 01:00:34,756
So you're going to scatter
every last one of them.

1409
01:00:35,256 --> 01:00:37,634
(Ivory)
Phantom Thief G is straight ahead!

1410
01:00:37,717 --> 01:00:41,095
(Announcement) G-SQUAD
DEPLOYMENT IN THREE MINUTES.

1411
01:00:41,179 --> 01:00:43,556
(G-Squad) *skitter-skiss~!*

1412
01:00:43,639 --> 01:00:45,641
Heh. If you want
to move forward,

1413
01:00:45,725 --> 01:00:48,603
I suppose you'll have to
go through us first.

1414
01:00:49,103 --> 01:00:50,271
(Butt Detective)
We're breaking through.

1415
01:00:51,939 --> 01:00:53,608
(G-Squad) *skitter skitter~!*

1416
01:00:53,691 --> 01:00:56,527
(Striking sounds)

1417
01:00:56,611 --> 01:01:00,323
(Phantom Thief G) Soon, the
world will be dyed in darkness.

1418
01:01:00,406 --> 01:01:04,243
G will stand at the very
top of the living world.

1419
01:01:04,327 --> 01:01:05,286
Fuhahaha!

1420
01:01:05,370 --> 01:01:06,037
Hm?

1421
01:01:07,080 --> 01:01:07,747
Hah!

1422
01:01:07,830 --> 01:01:10,208
(Butt Detective & Phantom Thief U)
Haah... haah...

1423
01:01:10,291 --> 01:01:13,419
Once again, allow me
to take the Moonlight Stone.

1424
01:01:13,503 --> 01:01:15,588
As if we'd hand it over.

1425
01:01:15,672 --> 01:01:18,716
Without fuel,
the G-Shuttle goes down.

1426
01:01:18,800 --> 01:01:20,093
Shadow G!

1427
01:01:24,722 --> 01:01:26,140
(Phantom Thief U) I've had them—

1428
01:01:26,224 --> 01:01:27,809
—take a little nap.

1429
01:01:28,309 --> 01:01:31,562
You had no choice but to
come aboard the G-Shuttle,

1430
01:01:32,063 --> 01:01:35,149
but it seems your escape
route's been sealed off.

1431
01:01:35,233 --> 01:01:36,943
You're all alone now.

1432
01:01:37,026 --> 01:01:37,985
Ah!

1433
01:01:38,486 --> 01:01:42,198
(Announcement) G-SQUAD
DEPLOYMENT IN THIRTY SECONDS.

1434
01:01:42,281 --> 01:01:44,200
(Ivory) At the very
front of the command room,

1435
01:01:44,283 --> 01:01:46,619
there's a red button
that stops the deployment.

1436
01:01:48,162 --> 01:01:50,832
Tch! You just
had to butt in!

1437
01:01:53,126 --> 01:01:55,002
G-Gun! Hah!

1438
01:01:55,086 --> 01:01:56,796
(Both) Ah! Ngh...

1439
01:01:56,879 --> 01:01:58,047
(Phantom Thief G) G-Lance!

1440
01:01:59,757 --> 01:02:01,342
(Both) Ah! Ngh...

1441
01:02:01,426 --> 01:02:02,385
(Phantom Thief G) G-Bomb!

1442
01:02:03,761 --> 01:02:04,595
Hah!

1443
01:02:04,679 --> 01:02:05,930
(Both) Ngh...

1444
01:02:06,013 --> 01:02:07,348
Haah... haah...

1445
01:02:09,642 --> 01:02:11,561
At this distance...

1446
01:02:13,104 --> 01:02:15,940
I've already set your
"excuse me" in motion.

1447
01:02:17,066 --> 01:02:18,276
(Phantom Thief G) What?!

1448
01:02:18,776 --> 01:02:21,237
Ngh... my fingers
won't move...

1449
01:02:21,737 --> 01:02:24,073
(Announcement) G-SQUAD
DEPLOYMENT IN TEN SECONDS.

1450
01:02:24,157 --> 01:02:27,326
What's this? You're
both falling apart.

1451
01:02:27,410 --> 01:02:29,579
-(Phantom Thief G) G-Blade!
-(Announcement) SEVEN. SIX...

1452
01:02:29,662 --> 01:02:32,331
(Butt Detective) Putting
everything I have left into this—

1453
01:02:32,415 --> 01:02:34,333
—if you'll excuse—

1454
01:02:34,417 --> 01:02:36,794
(Phantom Thief G)
Victory is miiine~!

1455
01:02:36,878 --> 01:02:38,463
—down you go!

1456
01:02:38,546 --> 01:02:39,505
(Announcement) ONE.

1457
01:02:41,382 --> 01:02:41,883
(Phantom Thief G) Guohh!

1458
01:02:42,592 --> 01:02:43,092
Guohh!

1459
01:02:43,718 --> 01:02:47,054
Guwaaahh~!

1460
01:02:47,847 --> 01:02:49,682
Guwaah!

1461
01:02:51,559 --> 01:02:53,686
(Announcement)
G-SQUAD DEPLOYMENT, HALTED.

1462
01:02:53,769 --> 01:02:56,689
ENTERING LANDING
SEQUENCE IN TEN MINUTES.

1463
01:02:57,523 --> 01:02:59,150
-(Brown) It stopped!
-(Ivory) Phew...

1464
01:02:59,233 --> 01:03:01,611
Damn it! Damn it! Daaamn it!

1465
01:03:01,694 --> 01:03:04,363
I was so close~!

1466
01:03:04,447 --> 01:03:05,531
(Butt Detective)
Tell me something.

1467
01:03:05,615 --> 01:03:06,115
Huh?

1468
01:03:06,699 --> 01:03:08,075
Why do all of this?

1469
01:03:08,159 --> 01:03:09,368
Ah...

1470
01:03:10,661 --> 01:03:12,497
Broadcasting to every monitor.

1471
01:03:13,289 --> 01:03:15,082
(Everyone) What's this?
Is that Butt Detective?

1472
01:03:15,166 --> 01:03:16,709
What's going on?
Is that him?

1473
01:03:16,793 --> 01:03:18,503
(Suzu and co.) Hm?

1474
01:03:19,921 --> 01:03:21,005
We've been—

1475
01:03:21,088 --> 01:03:22,798
—for as long as
anyone can remember—

1476
01:03:22,882 --> 01:03:26,302
hated, like it was just
the natural order of things.

1477
01:03:27,136 --> 01:03:31,057
So I hate every one of
you, living your carefree lives!

1478
01:03:31,140 --> 01:03:32,642
The Dark Age Plan

1479
01:03:32,725 --> 01:03:35,311
is my revenge against
every living thing!

1480
01:03:35,394 --> 01:03:38,147
As if any of you could
understand how I feel!

1481
01:03:38,231 --> 01:03:40,233
No. I can't.

1482
01:03:40,733 --> 01:03:41,943
But there's one
thing I understand—

1483
01:03:42,026 --> 01:03:44,820
who that plan
would hurt most of all.

1484
01:03:44,904 --> 01:03:46,697
Just that much,
I understand.

1485
01:03:46,781 --> 01:03:49,367
Heh... I see. How ironic.

1486
01:03:49,450 --> 01:03:50,243
(Phantom Thief G) Huh?

1487
01:03:50,743 --> 01:03:52,203
(Butt Detective) The one
who'd be hurt most of all

1488
01:03:52,912 --> 01:03:55,665
is you, Phantom Thief G.

1489
01:03:55,748 --> 01:03:56,707
Ah...

1490
01:03:57,458 --> 01:03:58,835
(Butt Detective)
Unleash G upon the world,

1491
01:03:58,918 --> 01:04:01,838
and you know full well the
surface will become a living nightmare.

1492
01:04:02,421 --> 01:04:03,506
But that would only be

1493
01:04:03,589 --> 01:04:06,050
you proving to
yourself, all over again,

1494
01:04:06,133 --> 01:04:09,762
that the world hates you—an
act that would only tear yourself apart...

1495
01:04:10,555 --> 01:04:11,847
Is that...

1496
01:04:11,931 --> 01:04:14,225
...really what you want?

1497
01:04:14,308 --> 01:04:15,643
Guh...

1498
01:04:16,894 --> 01:04:18,396
(Young Phantom Thief U)
Come on over here.

1499
01:04:18,479 --> 01:04:19,355
(Young Phantom Thief G) Huh?

1500
01:04:20,565 --> 01:04:21,732
O-okay.

1501
01:04:23,693 --> 01:04:26,821
What's your name?

1502
01:04:26,904 --> 01:04:28,281
Gorou.

1503
01:04:28,906 --> 01:04:29,991
(Berry) Oh my, indeed!

1504
01:04:30,074 --> 01:04:32,118
(Karasuda)
Caw~ Got somethin' in my eye.

1505
01:04:32,618 --> 01:04:35,371
(Young Phantom Thief U)
Someday, I'm going to the moon.

1506
01:04:35,454 --> 01:04:37,873
Hm? Ah...

1507
01:04:40,459 --> 01:04:43,462
(Karasuda)
Heeey, it's suppertime!

1508
01:04:45,464 --> 01:04:47,300
Want to come with me?

1509
01:04:47,383 --> 01:04:48,426
(Young Phantom Thief G) Ah...

1510
01:04:50,845 --> 01:04:52,763
Nah, I'm good.

1511
01:04:52,847 --> 01:04:55,683
People just get
creeped out by me anyway.

1512
01:04:55,766 --> 01:04:57,018
(Young Phantom Thief U) I see.

1513
01:04:57,101 --> 01:04:59,896
Well, come along
whenever you feel like it.

1514
01:05:03,441 --> 01:05:04,483
(Young Phantom Thief G) Ngh...

1515
01:05:04,567 --> 01:05:05,943
(Phantom Thief U)
Lift your head up.

1516
01:05:06,444 --> 01:05:07,695
Ah...

1517
01:05:08,195 --> 01:05:11,073
(Phantom Thief U) The moon looks
even bigger now than it did back then.

1518
01:05:11,866 --> 01:05:12,533
(Phantom Thief G) Ah...

1519
01:05:18,789 --> 01:05:21,000
I mean... I mean, come on—

1520
01:05:21,083 --> 01:05:23,669
the moment you
people see us,

1521
01:05:23,753 --> 01:05:25,463
you scream bloody murder—

1522
01:05:25,546 --> 01:05:28,382
swatting us with
newspapers, spraying us,

1523
01:05:28,466 --> 01:05:30,927
trapping us in those
sticky little houses—

1524
01:05:31,010 --> 01:05:32,720
forget being friends,

1525
01:05:32,803 --> 01:05:35,806
you won't even listen
to a word we say!

1526
01:05:35,890 --> 01:05:37,934
Hgh... ngh...

1527
01:05:38,017 --> 01:05:40,770
There's nowhere in
this whole world—

1528
01:05:40,853 --> 01:05:43,397
—nowhere for us to belong!

1529
01:05:43,481 --> 01:05:45,608
Is that really so?

1530
01:05:45,691 --> 01:05:46,817
Huh?

1531
01:05:47,568 --> 01:05:49,695
You're not the only one

1532
01:05:49,779 --> 01:05:52,531
searching for a
place to belong.

1533
01:05:52,615 --> 01:05:53,282
Ah...

1534
01:05:53,866 --> 01:05:57,703
The idol hopefuls gathered
on Stardust Island,

1535
01:05:57,787 --> 01:06:00,665
Brown and Ivory,
back in their day,

1536
01:06:00,748 --> 01:06:04,627
and countless others,
all across the world...

1537
01:06:05,127 --> 01:06:07,129
But even so,

1538
01:06:07,213 --> 01:06:10,257
is it right to change the
world through revenge?

1539
01:06:10,341 --> 01:06:11,967
Then what am
I supposed to do?

1540
01:06:12,468 --> 01:06:15,137
(Butt Detective) Look back,
once more, and think carefully.

1541
01:06:15,221 --> 01:06:15,721
Huh?

1542
01:06:16,389 --> 01:06:18,599
Wasn't there ever someone,

1543
01:06:18,683 --> 01:06:19,934
who reached out
a hand to you?

1544
01:06:20,017 --> 01:06:21,394
Ah...

1545
01:06:22,812 --> 01:06:23,896
(Phantom Thief U) Back then,

1546
01:06:24,397 --> 01:06:27,692
if Gorou had said he'd
come along with me,

1547
01:06:27,775 --> 01:06:32,363
we might have become
friends, the two of us.

1548
01:06:32,446 --> 01:06:33,656
Ah...

1549
01:06:34,156 --> 01:06:36,075
(Butt Detective) If you'd
found the courage

1550
01:06:36,659 --> 01:06:38,744
to take the hand
someone reached out to you,

1551
01:06:38,828 --> 01:06:41,580
perhaps there would
have been a place there

1552
01:06:41,664 --> 01:06:42,957
where you could
live as yourself?

1553
01:06:43,749 --> 01:06:45,501
(Warning sound)

1554
01:06:45,584 --> 01:06:48,838
L-lies. Lies.

1555
01:06:48,921 --> 01:06:50,506
It's all lies!

1556
01:06:50,589 --> 01:06:51,465
Huh?

1557
01:06:51,549 --> 01:06:53,926
Heh~?

1558
01:06:55,344 --> 01:06:56,262
Sniff...

1559
01:06:56,971 --> 01:06:59,515
Now we can brace
for the drop.

1560
01:07:00,474 --> 01:07:02,560
(Announcement)
G-SHUTTLE, DESCENDING.

1561
01:07:05,021 --> 01:07:06,397
-(Phantom Thief U) Whoa!
-(Butt Detective) Ngh...

1562
01:07:06,480 --> 01:07:07,481
(Butt Detective) Ngh...

1563
01:07:08,649 --> 01:07:09,483
Hm?

1564
01:07:12,653 --> 01:07:15,614
(Ivory) Hm? The shuttle's
started a rapid descent.

1565
01:07:15,698 --> 01:07:17,825
At this rate, it'll crash.

1566
01:07:17,908 --> 01:07:18,576
What?!

1567
01:07:20,036 --> 01:07:21,537
Butt Detective!

1568
01:07:21,620 --> 01:07:22,288
(Ivory) Ah—

1569
01:07:27,001 --> 01:07:27,501
(Brown) Ngh.

1570
01:07:27,585 --> 01:07:30,212
(Chief Maltese) Brown!
We just got word from down below!

1571
01:07:30,296 --> 01:07:32,506
(Brown) Everyone,
help Butt Detective!

1572
01:07:32,590 --> 01:07:33,299
(Everyone) Yes! Right!

1573
01:07:33,382 --> 01:07:34,759
(Ivory) Heading
straight into the ocean.

1574
01:07:34,842 --> 01:07:36,635
Brace for impact!

1575
01:07:36,719 --> 01:07:37,720
(Both) Ngh...

1576
01:07:42,767 --> 01:07:44,935
Never give up on your
dream, no matter what.

1577
01:07:45,019 --> 01:07:46,145
My dream

1578
01:07:46,228 --> 01:07:49,482
is to become a great
detective, just like Butt Detective!

1579
01:07:49,982 --> 01:07:51,442
So until that day comes,

1580
01:07:51,525 --> 01:07:53,903
please, stay by my side!

1581
01:07:58,866 --> 01:08:00,785
Butt Detective!

1582
01:08:00,868 --> 01:08:02,745
(Everyone) Butt Detective!

1583
01:08:02,828 --> 01:08:04,455
(Both) Butt Detective...

1584
01:08:04,538 --> 01:08:06,165
Butt Detective...

1585
01:08:06,248 --> 01:08:08,375
(Suzu and co.) Butt Detective...

1586
01:08:14,215 --> 01:08:14,965
(Butt Detective) Hm?

1587
01:08:15,049 --> 01:08:15,966
(Phantom Thief U) Ah.

1588
01:08:20,763 --> 01:08:21,639
Ah.

1589
01:08:23,474 --> 01:08:24,433
Ah.

1590
01:08:26,519 --> 01:08:27,186
(Butt Detective) Hm.

1591
01:08:27,269 --> 01:08:28,771
Ah...

1592
01:08:49,083 --> 01:08:51,919
(Brown) Yes!!
Thank goodness!

1593
01:08:59,927 --> 01:09:01,345
(Phantom Thief U) I suppose we
can call the game—

1594
01:09:01,428 --> 01:09:04,098
—our win, then?

1595
01:09:04,598 --> 01:09:06,809
(Butt Detective) Phantom Thief U.
Your hand, if you would.

1596
01:09:09,937 --> 01:09:10,771
Ah...

1597
01:09:13,983 --> 01:09:14,942
Oh!

1598
01:09:15,693 --> 01:09:18,779
Are you sure? I'm
a phantom thief, you know.

1599
01:09:18,863 --> 01:09:20,364
The Moonlight Stone

1600
01:09:20,447 --> 01:09:23,242
should be returned to
where it belongs, I think.

1601
01:09:35,171 --> 01:09:37,840
Sounds like that
was the right answer.

1602
01:09:37,923 --> 01:09:38,799
Ah.

1603
01:09:41,260 --> 01:09:42,219
(Young Phantom Thief U) Ah.

1604
01:09:47,182 --> 01:09:48,225
Aah.

1605
01:09:51,353 --> 01:09:52,021
Ah.

1606
01:09:59,278 --> 01:10:01,197
I should be taking
my leave now.

1607
01:10:01,280 --> 01:10:02,448
(Butt Detective) Hm.

1608
01:10:02,531 --> 01:10:04,408
(Phantom Thief U) As thanks
for giving it back,

1609
01:10:04,491 --> 01:10:07,286
let me show you the
Moonlight Stone's true power.

1610
01:10:08,037 --> 01:10:09,747
Beautiful world—

1611
01:10:10,497 --> 01:10:12,207
—come, before me!

1612
01:10:36,523 --> 01:10:37,608
Heh...

1613
01:10:39,068 --> 01:10:40,277
Whew~

1614
01:10:43,197 --> 01:10:45,240
I love this planet.

1615
01:10:45,324 --> 01:10:47,201
Yes. So do I.

1616
01:10:50,204 --> 01:10:52,498
(Brown) Pipi Zhentaaan!

1617
01:10:53,123 --> 01:10:54,250
Let's go together.

1618
01:10:54,333 --> 01:10:55,000
Now.

1619
01:10:55,084 --> 01:10:56,210
(Brown) Huh? Whoa!

1620
01:10:56,293 --> 01:10:58,045
Wait, why? Whoaa!

1621
01:10:58,128 --> 01:10:58,963
(Butt Detective) Hm.

1622
01:11:00,756 --> 01:11:01,590
-(Brown) Eheheh.
-(Butt Detective) Heheh.

1623
01:11:03,384 --> 01:11:06,553
Hey~! Don't run, Ivory!

1624
01:11:06,637 --> 01:11:08,681
I'm Phantom Thief I.

1625
01:11:08,764 --> 01:11:11,934
If you're really a detective's
assistant, catch me someday.

1626
01:11:12,017 --> 01:11:13,018
Big brother~!

1627
01:11:13,102 --> 01:11:14,645
What did you—!

1628
01:11:14,728 --> 01:11:15,479
Huh?

1629
01:11:15,562 --> 01:11:18,565
Did she just...
call me big brother?

1630
01:11:19,066 --> 01:11:22,319
Ivoryyy!

1631
01:11:22,820 --> 01:11:25,197
(Chief Maltese)
Ohh, you're safe and sound!

1632
01:11:28,909 --> 01:11:30,369
(Phantom Thief N) So, what now?

1633
01:11:30,452 --> 01:11:32,496
I'm turning myself in,
to pay for my crimes.

1634
01:11:32,579 --> 01:11:33,330
(Phantom Thief N) For real?

1635
01:11:34,081 --> 01:11:36,333
So that the next time
I run into Butt Detective,

1636
01:11:36,417 --> 01:11:38,544
I can knock him
flat, fair and square.

1637
01:11:38,627 --> 01:11:40,504
(Phantom Thief N) That's so dumb~

1638
01:11:41,130 --> 01:11:42,756
Yeah, I think so too.

1639
01:11:42,840 --> 01:11:45,467
But somehow, I feel
weirdly refreshed.

1640
01:11:46,051 --> 01:11:47,636
(Phantom Thief N) Exhausting,
isn't it~

1641
01:11:47,720 --> 01:11:49,763
Hanging around an idiot.

1642
01:11:52,224 --> 01:11:53,726
(Sharp Ears)
A man resembling the boss—

1643
01:11:53,809 --> 01:11:55,519
(Perm) —has
been spotted~!

1644
01:11:55,602 --> 01:11:56,103
(Chief Maltese) Hmph!

1645
01:11:56,186 --> 01:11:58,480
Hm? Kind of a
shrimp, aren't ya.

1646
01:11:58,564 --> 01:12:00,399
You just called me small!

1647
01:12:00,482 --> 01:12:03,193
I'll make you regret
it, and fear me!

1648
01:12:03,277 --> 01:12:05,362
This is for the
peace of the town.

1649
01:12:05,446 --> 01:12:07,906
You don't scare
me one bit!

1650
01:12:07,990 --> 01:12:08,866
Yaaah!

1651
01:12:08,949 --> 01:12:10,576
-(Chief Maltese) Hup!
-(Phantom Thief G) Whoa!

1652
01:12:10,659 --> 01:12:12,286
-(Chief Maltese) Taah!
-(Phantom Thief G) Guah!

1653
01:12:13,162 --> 01:12:14,371
(Bushy Brow) Ippon!

1654
01:12:14,455 --> 01:12:15,539
Suspect secured~!

1655
01:12:16,165 --> 01:12:17,332
(Chief Maltese)
Surrender now!

1656
01:12:17,416 --> 01:12:19,543
D-do what you want!

1657
01:12:20,169 --> 01:12:21,712
(Phantom Thief K) Looks like
the Phantom Thief Academy

1658
01:12:21,795 --> 01:12:22,880
is finished too, huh.

1659
01:12:23,464 --> 01:12:26,300
(Ivory) So what's Phantom Thief U
gonna do now?

1660
01:12:26,383 --> 01:12:28,385
Enjoy a little
vacation, I suppose.

1661
01:12:28,469 --> 01:12:30,637
Mind if we tag along?

1662
01:12:30,721 --> 01:12:32,097
Suit yourselves.

1663
01:12:32,181 --> 01:12:34,850
As for me, I'll be
taking my leave here.

1664
01:12:34,933 --> 01:12:36,935
I've already got what
I came for, after all.

1665
01:12:37,019 --> 01:12:38,645
Hey, that's
Phantom Thief G's—

1666
01:12:39,271 --> 01:12:40,689
—that thing, isn't it?!

1667
01:12:40,773 --> 01:12:42,816
Sharp as ever,
that woman.

1668
01:12:42,900 --> 01:12:45,360
The only things
I'm interested in

1669
01:12:45,444 --> 01:12:46,904
are the ones that
make ME shine.

1670
01:12:47,529 --> 01:12:50,866
Whether you're friend or foe
makes no difference to me.

1671
01:12:50,949 --> 01:12:51,950
Well then,

1672
01:12:52,451 --> 01:12:54,411
farewell.

1673
01:12:54,912 --> 01:12:57,748
Heh. We're free spirits.

1674
01:12:57,831 --> 01:12:59,541
As long as we're
phantom thieves.

1675
01:13:00,376 --> 01:13:01,877
(Phantom Thief U)
Butt Detective, my boy.

1676
01:13:01,960 --> 01:13:04,254
That was quite the
exciting game.

1677
01:13:04,755 --> 01:13:07,841
I promise, I'll appear
before you again.

1678
01:13:08,967 --> 01:13:10,219
(Phantom Thief U) Adieu~

1679
01:13:12,846 --> 01:13:16,934
(Butt Detective) Phantom Thief U.
Next time we meet, I most certainly will—

1680
01:13:17,017 --> 01:13:18,018
(Brown) Ah!

1681
01:13:18,102 --> 01:13:19,728
I can see it up ahead!

1682
01:13:19,812 --> 01:13:21,563
(Everyone) Pipi Zhentaaan!

1683
01:13:21,647 --> 01:13:24,733
Thank you~!

1684
01:13:26,610 --> 01:13:28,987
(Both) Heheheh...

1685
01:13:29,071 --> 01:13:31,448
A true star is
someone whose light

1686
01:13:31,532 --> 01:13:34,159
kindles the brilliance
in everyone else.

1687
01:13:34,660 --> 01:13:35,202
That's right...

1688
01:13:35,786 --> 01:13:38,997
He truly is the star that
lights the moon—our Starbutt.

1689
01:13:39,081 --> 01:13:41,083
Oh, right!

1690
01:13:41,166 --> 01:13:44,545
What's your dream,
Butt Detective?

1691
01:13:45,045 --> 01:13:46,380
Hmmm.

1692
01:13:46,463 --> 01:13:49,967
Right now, it's eating a sweet
potato at the Lucky Cat

1693
01:13:50,050 --> 01:13:52,261
while sipping a nice cup of tea.

1694
01:13:52,344 --> 01:13:55,931
Huh? That's just...
every day, though.

1695
01:13:56,014 --> 01:13:58,142
Hm. I suppose it is.

1696
01:13:58,225 --> 01:13:59,435
(Brown) Heheheh.

1697
01:13:59,518 --> 01:14:01,353
(Both laughing)

1698
01:14:05,774 --> 01:14:09,403
Now then—from here on,
everyone's the star of the show!

1699
01:14:09,486 --> 01:14:13,615
A brilliant, shining
new star is born!

1700
01:14:14,199 --> 01:14:16,201
{\an8}♪~

1701
01:16:27,207 --> 01:16:29,209
{\an8}~♪
